<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">- WOL</book>
  <para style="h">1.Jaar-jaar ya</para>
  <para style="toc1">1.Jaar-jaar ya, muy téere bi jiitu te ëmb jaar-jaari jamono</para>
  <para style="toc2">1.Jaar-jaar ya</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Chroniques</para>
  <para style="mt1">1.Jaar-jaar ya</para>
  <para style="mt2">muy téere bi jiitu te ëmb jaar-jaari jamono</para>
  <para style="ip">Ñaari téerey <char style="bk">Jaar-jaar ya</char> ca limeefu maam ya la tënke cosaanu Israayil, doore ca Aadama, jaare ci Ibraayma, ba keroog bi bànni Israayil di jóge ca réew ya ñu leen gàddaayloo, délsi Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="ip">Téere yii di ñaax askan wi, ngir ñu xam ne njaaxum li dikkal nguuri Israayil ak Yuda terewul Yàlla di sàmmonte ak ay digeem ñeel askan wi. Moo tax bindkat bi indi jaloore yu mag yu Daawuda ak Suleymaan def ak li Yosafat ak Esekiyas ak Yosya def ngir yeesal diine ji ci biir Yuda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Téereb <char style="bk">Jaar-jaar ya</char> bu njëkk, ci ay limeefi maam la ubbee. Gannaaw loolu mu indi jaar-jaari Sawul ak Daawuda, ñaari buuri Israayil ya jiitu. Li téere bi tëje moo di gis-gis bi Daawuda am ci kër Yàlla ga Suleymaan doomam wara tabax.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yàlla fas na kóllëre ak Daawuda, bi mu ko nee: «Maay yékkati kenn ci saw askan mu wuutu la, jóge ci sa geño; te maay taxawal nguuram. Kookoo may tabaxal kër te maay taxawal ab jalam ba fàww. Man baayam laay doon, moom muy sama doom» (17.11-14). <char style="bk">1.Jaar-jaar ya</char> moo yem ba fa ñu nee: «Suleymaan toog ci jalub Aji Sax ji, di buur, wuutu baayam» (29.23).</para>
  <para style="im">Ci tënk:</para>
  <para style="ili">1.1—9.44. Limeefi maami waa kër Israayil taxaw na.</para>
  <para style="ili">10.1-14 Lu jëm ci deewug Sawul.</para>
  <para style="ili">11.1—23.1 Lu jëm ci nguurug Daawuda.</para>
  <para style="ili">23.2—27.34 Lu jëm ci kër Yàlla gi ak Leween ñi ak njiiti giiri Israayil.</para>
  <para style="ili">28.1—29.30 Li Daawuda def ci atam yu mujj yi.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1" />
  <para style="ms">Limeefi askan yi</para>
  <para style="mr">(Saar 1—9)</para>
  <para style="s1">Li ko dale ca Aadama ba ca Ibraayma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1" />Aadama mooy baayu Set, Set di baayu Enos, <verse eid="1CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2" />Enos di baayu Kenan, Kenan di baayu Maalaleel, Maalaleel di baayu Yeredd. <verse eid="1CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3" />Yeredd di baayu Enog, Enog di baayu Matusalem, Matusalem di baayu Lemeg, <verse eid="1CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4" />Lemeg di baayu Nóoyin, Nóoyin di baayu góor ñii di Sem ak Xam ak Yafet.<verse eid="1CH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5" />Doomi Yafet yu góor ñoo di Gomeer ak Magog ak Maday ak Yawaan ak Tubal ak Meseg ak Tiraas. <verse eid="1CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6" />Doomi Gomeer yu góor ñoo di Askenas ak Difaat ak Togarma. <verse eid="1CH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7" />Doomi Yawaan yu góor ñoo di Elisa ak Tarsis ak Kitim ak Dodanim.<verse eid="1CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8" />Doomi Xam yu góor ñoo di Kuus ak Misrayim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Misrayim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy Misra ba tey.</char></note> ak Puut ak Kanaan. <verse eid="1CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9" />Doomi Kuus yu góor ñoo di Saba ak Awila ak Sabta ak Raama ak Sabteka. Doomi Raama yu góor di Seba ak Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10" />Kuus moo jur Nimrodd, ki njëkk di jàmbaar ju siiw ci kaw suuf.<verse eid="1CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11" />Misrayim nag mooy maami Luddeen ñi ak Anameen ñi ak Leyabeen ñi ak Naftuyeen ñi <verse eid="1CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12" />ak Pataruseen ñi ak Kasluxeen ñi, ñooñee waa Filisti soqikoo, ak it Kaftoreen ñi.<verse eid="1CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13" />Kanaan moo taawloo Sidon, teg ca Ett. <verse eid="1CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14" />Kanaan mooy maamu Yebuseen ñi ak Amoreen ñi ak Girgaseen ñi. <verse eid="1CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15" />Mooy maamu Eween ñi ak Arkeen ñi ak Sineen ñi. <verse eid="1CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16" />Mooy maamu Arwàddeen ñi it ak Cemareen ñi ak Amateen ñi.<verse eid="1CH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17" />Doomi Sem yu góor ñoo di Elam ak Asur ak Arpagsàdd ak Ludd ak Aram. Góor ñi Aram jur<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">ñi Aram jur: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Njàlbéen ga</char> 10.23.</note> ñii la: Ucc ak Xuul ak Geter ak Meseg. <verse eid="1CH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18" />Arpagsàdd jur Sela, Sela jur Eber. <verse eid="1CH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19" />Eber moom jur ñaari doom yu góor. Kenn ki tudd Peleg (muy firi Séddalikoo), ndaxte ci jamonoom àddina dafa séddalikoo woon. Rakku Peleg ju góor mooy Yogtaan. <verse eid="1CH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20" />Yogtaan a jur Alamodàdd ak Selef ak Asarmawet ak Yerax <verse eid="1CH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21" />ak Adoram ak Usal ak Digla <verse eid="1CH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22" />ak Ebal ak Abimayel ak Seba <verse eid="1CH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23" />ak Ofir ak Awila ak Yobab. Ñooñu ñépp di doomi Yogtaan yu góor.<verse eid="1CH 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24" />Ci tënk, lii mooy askanu Sem: Sem mooy baayu Arpagsàdd, Arpagsàdd di baayu Sela. <verse eid="1CH 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25" />Sela di baayu Eber, Eber di baayu Peleg, Peleg di baayu Rew. <verse eid="1CH 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26" />Rew mooy baayu Serug, Serug di baayu Naxor, Naxor di baayu Teraa. <verse eid="1CH 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27" />Teraa mooy baayu Ibraam miy Ibraayma.<verse eid="1CH 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Li ko dale ca Ibraayma ba ca Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28" />Doomi Ibraayma yu góor ñoo di Isaaxa ak Ismayla. <verse eid="1CH 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29" />Ñii lañu meññ: taawub Ismayla bu góor mooy Nebayot. Ña ca topp di Kedar ak Adabeel ak Mibsam <verse eid="1CH 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30" />ak Misma ak Duuma ak Maasa ak Adàdd ak Tema <verse eid="1CH 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31" />ak Yetur ak Nafis ak Kedama. Ñooñu ñooy doomi Ismayla yu góor.<verse eid="1CH 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32" />Ketura, nekkaaleb Ibraayma am naak moom doom yu góor. Ñuy Simran ak Yogsan ak Medan ak Majan ak Yisbag ak Suwa. Doomi Yogsan yu góor di Seba ak Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33" />Doomi Majan yu góor ñoo di Efa ak Efer ak Enog ak Abida ak Elda. Ñooñu ñépp xeetu Ketura lañu.<verse eid="1CH 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34" />Ibraayma mooy baayu Isaaxa. Doomi Isaaxa yu góor di Esawu ak Israayil<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.34 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Israayil </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ak Yanqóoba, kenn ki la.</char></note>.<verse eid="1CH 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35" />Doomi Esawu yu góor ñoo di Elifas ak Rewel ak Yewus ak Yalam ak Kore. <verse eid="1CH 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36" />Doomi Elifas yu góor ñoo di Teman ak Omar ak Cefo ak Gatam ak Kenas ak Amaleg mi mu am ak Timna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.36 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Timna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Njàlbéen ga</char> 36.12.</note>. <verse eid="1CH 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37" />Doomi Rewel yu góor ñoo di Naxat ak Sera ak Saama ak Misa.<verse eid="1CH 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lu jëm ci ña sancoon réewum Edom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38" />Ñi sancoon Edom ñoo askanoo ci doomi Seyir yu góor. Ñoo di Lotan ak Sobal ak Cibeyon ak Ana ak Dison ak Eccer ak Disan. <verse eid="1CH 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39" />Doomi Lotan yu góor ñoo di Ori ak Omam. Jigéenub Lotan di Timna. <verse eid="1CH 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40" />Doomi Sobal yu góor ñoo di Alwan ak Manaxat ak Ebal ak Sefi ak Onam. Doomi Cibeyon yu góor di Aya ak Ana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41" />Doomu Ana ju góor moo di Dison. Doomi Dison yu góor ñoo di Amran ak Esban ak Yittran ak Keran. <verse eid="1CH 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42" />Doomi Eccer yu góor ñoo di Bilan ak Saawan ak Yakan. Doomi Disan yu góor di Ucc ak Aran.<verse eid="1CH 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43" />Buur ya falu woon ca réewum Edom, lu jiitu benn buuru <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> di falu, ñii la: Bela doomu Bewor ju góor. Dinaba moo doon péeyam. <verse eid="1CH 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44" />Ba Bela faatoo, Yobab doomu Sera ma dëkk Boccara moo falu buur, wuutu ko. <verse eid="1CH 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45" />Ba Yobab faatoo, Usam ma bokk ci diiwaanu waa Teman falu buur, wuutu ko. <verse eid="1CH 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46" />Ba Usam faatoo, Adàdd doomu Bedàdd ju góor ja duma woon waa Majan ca réewu Mowab, daldi falu buur, wuutu ko. Péeyam moo doon Awit. <verse eid="1CH 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47" />Ba Adàdd faatoo, Samla ma dëkk Masreka moo falu buur, wuutu ko. <verse eid="1CH 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48" />Ba Samla faatoo, Sawul mu Rexobot Efraat moo falu buur, wuutu ko. <verse eid="1CH 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49" />Ba Sawul faatoo, Baal Anan doomu Agbor ju góor moo falu buur, wuutu ko. <verse eid="1CH 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50" />Ba Baal Anan faatoo, Adàdd moo falu buur, wuutu ko. Pawu moo doon péeyam, soxnaam di Metabeel ma Mataredd doomu Mesaab di yaayam.<verse eid="1CH 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51" />Gannaaw ba Adàdd faatoo, kilifa ya jiite Edom ñoo di Timna ak Alwa ak Yetet <verse eid="1CH 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52" />ak Olibama ak Ela ak Pinon <verse eid="1CH 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53" />ak Kenas ak Teman ak Mibcar <verse eid="1CH 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54" />ak Magdiyel ak Iram. Ñooñoo doon kilifay Edom.<verse eid="1CH 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2" />
  <para style="ms2">Doomi Israayil ñii la</para>
  <para style="mr">(Saar 2—7)</para>
  <para style="s1">Askanu Yuda, maamu Daawudaa ngii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1" />Góor ñiy doomi Yanqóoba mi ñuy wax itam Israayil ñoo di Ruben ak Simeyon ak Lewi ak Yuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yuda </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy maamu Daawuda. Seetal ci 2.15.</char></note> ak Isaakar ak Sabulon <verse eid="1CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2" />ak Dan ak Yuusufa ak Beñamin ak Neftali ak Gàdd ak Aser.<verse eid="1CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3" />Doomi Yuda yu góor ñoo di Er ak Onan ak Sela. Ñooñu, doomu Suwa, ndawas Kanaaneen sa la ko amal. Waaye Er, taawub Yuda boobu, doonoon ku <char style="w" lemma="Aji Sax j-:">Aji Sax ji</char> seede coxoram; Aji Sax ji rey ko.<verse eid="1CH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4" />Ku ñuy wax Tamar, gorob Yuda ba doomam doon denc, am ak Yuda Peres ak Sera. Doomi Yuda yu góor yépp di juróom.<verse eid="1CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5" />Doomi Peres yu góor nag di Esron ak Amul.<verse eid="1CH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6" />Doomi Sera yu góor ñoo di Simri ak Etan ak Eman ak Kalkol ak Daara; ñoom ñépp di juróom.<verse eid="1CH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7" />Doomu Karmi ju góor moo di Akar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Akar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy Akan ba tey. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">Yosuwe</char> saar 7.</note> (muy firi Musiba), ki yóbbe woon Israayil musiba ba mu feccee worma ca mbir ya ñu aayaloon, jagleel ko Yàlla.<verse eid="1CH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8" />Doomu Etan ju góor moo di Asaryaa.<verse eid="1CH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9" />Doomi Esron yu góor yi mu am ñoo di Yeraxmeel ak Ram ak Kaleb, mooy Kelubay ba tey.<verse eid="1CH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10" />Ram mooy baayu Aminadab, Aminadab di baayu Naason, kilifag giirug Yuda.<verse eid="1CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11" />Naason mooy baayu Salma, Salma di baayu Bowas.<verse eid="1CH 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12" />Bowas mooy baayu Obedd, Obedd di baayu Yese.<verse eid="1CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13" />Yese mooy baayu Elyab, taawam bu góor, Abinadab di tofoom, Simeya di ñetteelu doomam ju góor.<verse eid="1CH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14" />Netaneel mooy ñeenteelu doomam ju góor, Raday di juróomeelu doomam ju góor.<verse eid="1CH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15" />Occem a ca topp di juróom benneel, Daawuda toppaat ca, di juróom ñaareelu doomam ju góor.<verse eid="1CH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16" />Ñooñu seeni jigéen a doon Ceruya ak Abigayil. Doomi Ceruya yu góor di Abisay, Yowab ak Asayel, ñuy ñett.<verse eid="1CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17" />Abigayil moo jur Amasa ma Yeter Ismayleen ba di baayam.<verse eid="1CH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18" />Kaleb miy doomu Esron ju góor am na ñetti doom yu góor ak soxnaam yi tudd Asuba ak Yeryot, ñuy: Yeser, Sobab ak Ardon.<verse eid="1CH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19" />Ba Asuba faatoo, Kaleb jël Efrata, mu am ak moom Ur.<verse eid="1CH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20" />Ur mooy baayu Uri, Uri di baayu Beccalel.<verse eid="1CH 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21" />Gannaaw gi, Esron tollu ci juróom benn fukki at, jël doomu Makir miy baayu Galàdd. Mu am ca doom ju góor ju ñuy wax Segub.<verse eid="1CH 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22" />Segub mooy baayu Yayir ma tegoon loxo ñaar fukki dëkk ak ñett ca diiwaanu Galàdd.<verse eid="1CH 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23" />Waaye Gesureen ñaak Arameen ña nangu ca ñoom dëkk yu ndaw ya ca Yayir, boole ca Kenat ak dëkk ya ca bokk, lépp di juróom benn fukki dëkk. Góor ñooñu ñépp nag doomi Makir lañu woon, moom baayu Galàdd.<verse eid="1CH 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24" />Gannaaw ba Esron faatoo ca Kaleb Efrata, la Abya ma doon soxnaam jur doomu Esron ja ñuy wax Asuur mi sanc Tekowa.<verse eid="1CH 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25" />Góor ñi Yeraxmeel, taawub Esron di seen baay ñoo di Ram may taawam ak Buna ak Oren ak Occem ak Axya.<verse eid="1CH 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26" />Yeraxmeel jëlaat na soxna su ñuy wax Atara, am ca ku ñuy wax Onam.<verse eid="1CH 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27" />Ram, taawub Yeraxmeel, ay doomam yu góor ñoo di Màcc ak Yamin ak Eker.<verse eid="1CH 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28" />Doomi Onam yu góor ñoo di Samay ak Yada. Doomi Samay yu góor di Nadab ak Abisur.<verse eid="1CH 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29" />Abisur nag jël Abiyayil, am ca Aban ak Molit.<verse eid="1CH 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30" />Doomi Nadab yu góor ñoo di Selet ak Apayim. Selet faatu na te amul doom.<verse eid="1CH 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31" />Doomu Apayim ju góor moo di Yisey. Doomu Yisey ju góor moo di Sesan. Doomu Sesan di Axlay.<verse eid="1CH 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32" />Góor ñi Yada mi bokk ak Samay jur ñoo di Yeter ak Yonatan. Yeter faatu na te amul doom.<verse eid="1CH 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33" />Doomi Yonatan yu góor ñoo di Pelet ak Sasa. Ñooñu ñoo soqikoo ci Yeraxmeel.<verse eid="1CH 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34" />Sesan nag amul doom ju góor waaye ay jigéen la am. Sesan amoon na jaamu waa Misra bu tudd Yarxa. <verse eid="1CH 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35" />Mu may Yarxa kenn ciy doomam yu jigéen. Mu amal ko ca doom ju góor ju tudd Atay.<verse eid="1CH 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36" />Atay mooy baayu Natan, Natan di baayu Sabàdd.<verse eid="1CH 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37" />Sabàdd mooy baayu Eflal, Eflal di baayu Obedd.<verse eid="1CH 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38" />Obedd mooy baayu Yewu, Yewu di baayu Asaryaa.<verse eid="1CH 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39" />Asaryaa mooy baayu Elecc, Elecc di baayu Elasa.<verse eid="1CH 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40" />Elasa mooy baayu Sismay, Sismay di baayu Salum.<verse eid="1CH 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41" />Salum mooy baayu Yekamya, Yekamya di baayu Elisama.<verse eid="1CH 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42" />Góor ñi Kaleb, ma bokk ak Yeraxmeel, di seen baay ñoo di Mesa, may taawam, te di baayu Sif ak Maresa, baayu Ebron.<verse eid="1CH 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43" />Doomi Ebron yu góor ñoo di Kore ak Tapuwa ak Rekem ak Sema.<verse eid="1CH 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44" />Sema mooy baayu Raxam, Raxam di baayu Yorkam, Rekem mooy baayu Samay.<verse eid="1CH 2:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45" />Samay mooy baayu Mawon, Mawon di baayu Bet Cur.<verse eid="1CH 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46" />Kaleb, Efa nekkaaleem la woon. Moo jur Karan ak Mocca ak Gases. Karan am na doom ju góor ju mu tudde Gases moom it.<verse eid="1CH 2:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47" />Doomi Yaday yu góor ñoo di Regem ak Yotam ak Gesan ak Pelet ak Efa ak Saaf.<verse eid="1CH 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48" />Kaleb amoon na beneen nekkaale bu ñuy wax Maaka. Mu am ak moom Seber ak Tirxana.<verse eid="1CH 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49" />Gannaaw mu amaat ku ñuy wax Saaf di baayu Madmana, ak ku ñuy wax Sewa, di baayu Magbena ak Gibeya. Doomu Kaleb ju jigéen mooy Agsa.<verse eid="1CH 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50" />Ñeneen a ngi di ñu askanoo ci Kaleb: Ur taawam baak soxnaam sa ñuy wax Efrata, am na ñetti doom yu góor di Sobal ma sanc Kiryaat Yarim, <verse eid="1CH 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51" />ak Salma ma sanc Betleyem, ak Aref ma sanc Bet Gader.<verse eid="1CH 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52" />Sobal ma sanc Kiryaat Yarim moo meññ waa Arowe ak genn-wàllu waa Menuxot.<verse eid="1CH 2:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53" />Sobal moo meññ itam làngi Kiryaat Yarim yii di Yetereen ñi ak Puuteen ñi ak Sumateen ñi ak Misrayeen ñi. Ci ñooñu la Corateen ñeek Estawleen ñi soqikoo.<verse eid="1CH 2:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54" />Salma moo meññ waa Betleyem ak Netofa ak Aterot Bet Yowab ak genn-wàllu waa Manaxat ak Coreyeen ñi.<verse eid="1CH 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55" />Salma moo meññ itam làngi bindkat ya dëkk Yabecc, di Tirateen ñi ak Simateen ñi ak Sukateen ñi. Ñooñu ay Keñeen lañu ñu soqikoo ca Amat maamu waa kër Rekab.<verse eid="1CH 2:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ñii ñooy doomi Daawuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1" />Doomi Daawuda yu góor ya mu amoon ca Ebron ñoo di: Amnon taaw ba Axinowam ma dëkkoon Yisreel di ndeyam. Ñaareelu doomam ju góor di Dañeel ma Abigayil ma dëkkoon Karmel di ndeyam. <verse eid="1CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2" />Ñetteelu doomam ju góor moo di Absalom ma Maaka doomu Talmay buurub Gesur di ndeyam. Ñeenteel ba di Adoña ma Agit di ndeyam. <verse eid="1CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3" />Juróomeelu doomam ju góor moo di Sefatiya, ma Abital di ndeyam. Juróom benneelu doomam ju góor di Ittireyam ma mu am ak soxnaam sa ñuy wax Egla. <verse eid="1CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4" />Juróom benn ñooñu la Daawuda am ca Ebron ga mu falu buur juróom ñaari at ak juróom benni weer.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 3:4">Fanweeri at ak ñett nag la Daawuda falu ca Yerusalem. <verse eid="1CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5" />Ña Daawuda am ca Yerusalem ñoo di Simeya ak Sobab ak Natan ak Suleymaan. Ñooñu ñeent Batseba mi Amyel di baayam mooy seen ndey. <verse eid="1CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6" />Daawuda am na it Ibaar ak Elisama ak Elifelet. <verse eid="1CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7" />Am na Noga ak Nefeg ak Yafya. <verse eid="1CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8" />Am na Elisama ak Elyada ak Elifelet. Muy yeneen juróom ñeenti doomi Daawuda yu góor. <verse eid="1CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9" />Muy mboolem doomi Daawuda yu góor ba mu des doom yi mu am ak ay nekkaaleem. Amoon na itam doom ju jigéen ju ñuy wax Tamar.<verse eid="1CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñii ñooy buuri Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10" />Doomu Suleymaan mooy Robowam mi jur Abya, mu jur Asa, mu jur Yosafat. <verse eid="1CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11" />Yosafat jur Yexoram, mu jur Axasya, mu jur Yowas, <verse eid="1CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12" />mu jur Amaciya, mu jur Asaryaa, mu jur Yotam; <verse eid="1CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13" />Yotam jur Axas, mu jur Esekiyas, mu jur Manase. <verse eid="1CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14" />Manase moo jur Amon mi jur Yosya. <verse eid="1CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15" />Doomi Yosya yu góor ñoo di Yoxanan, ñaareelu doomam di Yoyakim, ñetteel ba di Cedesyas, ñeenteel ba di Salum. <verse eid="1CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16" />Doomi Yoyakim yu góor ñoo di Yekoña ak Cedesyas.<verse eid="1CH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu buur gannaaw gàddaay ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17" />Yekoña lañu yóbbu ngàllo Babilon. Doomi Yekoña yu góor ñoo di Selcel <verse eid="1CH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18" />ak Malkiram ak Pedaya ak Senacar ak Yekamya ak Osama ak Nedabya. <verse eid="1CH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19" />Doomi Pedaya yu góor ñoo di Sorobabel ak Simey. Sorobabel am na ñaari doom yu góor, Mesulam ak Anaña, ak doom ju jigéen ju ñuy wax Selomit. <verse eid="1CH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20" />Mu dellu am juróomi doom yu góor. Ñuy Asuba ak Oyel ak Berekya ak Asaja ak Yusab Xeset. <verse eid="1CH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21" />Ñi askanoo ci Anaña di ay góor ñoom ñépp di Pelaca ak Yesaya; ak itam doom yu góor yu Refaya ak yu Arnan ak yu Abdiyas ak yu Sekaña. <verse eid="1CH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22" />Ñi askanoo ci Sekaña ñoo di Semaya aki doomam yu góor, ñooy Atus ak Igal ak Baryax ak Neyarya ak Safat. Ñuy juróom benn. <verse eid="1CH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23" />Doomi Neyarya yu góor ñoo di Elyonay ak Esekiyas ak Asrikam, ñuy ñett. <verse eid="1CH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24" />Doomi Elyonay yu góor ñoo di Odawya ak Elyasib ak Pelaya ak Akub ak Yoxanan ak Delaya ak Anani, ñuy juróom ñaar.<verse eid="1CH 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yeneen làngi Yudaa ngi nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1" />Ñi askanoo ci Yuda ñoo di Peres ak Esron ak Karmi ak Ur ak Sobal. <verse eid="1CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2" />Reyaya doomu Sobal mooy baayu Yaxat, Yaxat di baayu Axumay ak Lawat. Ñaar ñooñu ñoo meññ làngi Corateen ñi. <verse eid="1CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3" />Ñi sant Etam ñoo di Yisreel ak Yisma ak Yitbas. Àccelelponi mooy seenub jigéen. <verse eid="1CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4" />Penuwel mi jur Gedor, ak Eser mi jur Usa ñoo doon góor ñi Ur di seen baay. Ur mooy taawub Efrata ma sanc Betleyem. <verse eid="1CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5" />Asuur ma sanc Tekowa amoon ñaari soxna: Ela ak Naara. <verse eid="1CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6" />Naara am ak moom Axusam ak Efer ak Temni ak Axastari. Ñooy doomi Naara yu góor. <verse eid="1CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7" />Ela am naak moom ay doom yu góor: Ceret ak Cowar ak Etnan <verse eid="1CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8" />ak Kocc mi doon baayu Anub ak Accobeba, te mooy maamu làngi Axarxel, góor ga Arum di baayam.<verse eid="1CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9" />Am na jenn way ju ñuy wax Yabecc. Moom lañu gënoona naw ci ñi mu bokkal. Yaayam tudde ko Yabecc ndax da ne: «Ci mitit wu tar laa ko jure<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yabecc </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dafa niroo ak baat biy firi mitit.</char></note>.» <verse eid="1CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10" />Yabecc nag woo Yàllay Israayil wall, ne ko: «Éy, soo ma barkeeloon a barkeel, yokk samag moomeel, ànd ak man, musal ma ci lu aay lu may yóbbe mitit.» Yàlla may ko la mu ñaan.<verse eid="1CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11" />Ku ñuy wax Kelub moo bokk ak Suxa, di baayu Mexir, Mexir mooy baayu Eston. <verse eid="1CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12" />Eston mooy baayu Bet Rafa ak Paseya ak Texina. Texina moo sanc dëkk ba ñuy wax Naxas. Ñooy ñoo dëkkoon Reka.<verse eid="1CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13" />Doomi Kenas yu góor ñoo di Otniyel ak Seraya. Doomi Otniyel yu góor ñooy Atàdd ak Meyonotay. <verse eid="1CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14" />Meyonotay mooy baayu Ofra, Seraya di baayu Yowab ma sancoon fa ñuy woowe xuru Liggéeykat ya ndax ay liggéeykat lañu woon. <verse eid="1CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15" />Doomi Kaleb, doomu Yefune, ñoo di Iru ak Ela ak Naam. Ela moo doon baayu Kenas.<verse eid="1CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16" />Doomi Yewalelel yu góor di Sif ak Sifa ak Tirya ak Asareel.<verse eid="1CH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17-18" />Doomi Esra yu góor di Yeter ak Meredd ak Efer ak Yalon. Bitya soxnas Meredd moo jur Maryaama ak Samay ak Yisbax ma jur Estemowa. Bitya moo doon doomu Firawna. Meredd amoon na itam soxnas waa Yuda, am ak moom Yeredd, ma sanc Gedor, ak Eber ma sanc Soko, ak Yekutiyel ma sanc Sanowa.<verse eid="1CH 4:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19" />Oja moo doon denc jigéenub Naxam. Ñoo meññ Garmeen ñi ña dëkke woon Keyla, ak Maakateen ña dëkke woon Estemowa.<verse eid="1CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20" />Doomi Simoŋ yu góor ñoo di Amnon ak Rina ak Ben Anan ak Tilon. Ñi askanoo ci Yisey ñoo di Soxet ak doomu Soxet ju góor. <verse eid="1CH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21" />Ña askanoo ci Sela, doomu Yuda ju góor, ñoo di Er ma sanc Leka, ak Lada ma sanc Maresa, ak itam làngi ya séq kër ga ñuy liggéeye lẽe ca Bet Asbeya. <verse eid="1CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22" />Sela ba tey moo meññ Yokim, boole ca ña dëkk Koseba ak ña dëkk Yowas ak Saraf te moomoon Mowab bala ñoo dellu Lexem. Mbir mu yàgg a ngoogu. <verse eid="1CH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23" />Ñooñu ay tabaxkati ndabi ban lañu woon. Ña nga dëkke woon Netayim Gedera, di fa liggéeyal buur.<verse eid="1CH 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Simeyon, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24" />Doomi Simeyon yu góor ñoo di Nemwel ak Yamin ak Yarib ak Sera ak Sawul. <verse eid="1CH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Sawul ñoo di Salum mi jur Mibsam mu jur Misma. <verse eid="1CH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26" />Ñi askanoo ci Misma di Amuwel mi jur Sakur mu jur Simey. <verse eid="1CH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27" />Simey amoon na fukki doom yu góor ak juróom benn, ak juróom benni doom yu jigéen waaye ñu góor ñi mu bokkal jabootuñu. Moo tax seeni làng yépp giiruñu ni làngi Yuda. <verse eid="1CH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28" />Ña nga dëkke woon Beerseba ca Molada ak Àccar Suwal. <verse eid="1CH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29" />Dëkke woon nañu Bilaa it ak Eccem ak Tolat. <verse eid="1CH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30" />Dëkke woon nañu Betuwel ak Xorma ak Ciglaag. <verse eid="1CH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31" />Dëkke woon nañu Bet Markabot ba tey ak Àccar Susim ak Bet Birey ak Saarayim. Looloo doon seeni dëkk ba jant ya Daawuda faloo. <verse eid="1CH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32" />Amoon nañu itam juróomi dëkk yu ndaw, muy Etam ak Ayin ak Rimon ak Token ak Asan. <verse eid="1CH 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33" />Ñu boole ca nag mboolem seen dëkk-dëkkaan yu ndaw ya wër dëkk yooyu ba ca Baal. Gox yooyu lañu dëkke woon te noonu lañu binde seen limeefu askan.<verse eid="1CH 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34" />Ni ñu lime kilifay làngi Simeyon nii la: Mesobab ak Yamleg ak Yosa, doomu Amaciya ju góor. <verse eid="1CH 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35" />Yowel ca la ak Yewu doomu Yosbiya miy doomu Seraya ju góor tey sëtub Asyel. <verse eid="1CH 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36" />Elyonay bokk na ca ak Yaakoba ak Yesoxaya ak Asaya ak Adiyel ak Yesimyel ak Benaya. <verse eid="1CH 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37" />Sisa it bokk na ca; mooy góor gay doomu Sifey, doomu Alon, doomu Yedaya, doomu Simri, doomu Semaya.<verse eid="1CH 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38" />Ñooñu ñu lim seen tur ay kilifa lañu woon ci seeni làng. Mujj nañu bare lool. <verse eid="1CH 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39" />Loolu tax ñu tas wuti Gedor, fa féeteek penkub xur wa, ngir amal seeni gàtt parlu. <verse eid="1CH 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40" />Ñu gis fa parlu mu naat te baax. Foofa it yaatu lool, am jàmm te dal. Ña fa dëkkoon lu jiitu nag ña nga bokkoon ci askanu Xam.<verse eid="1CH 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41" />Ñooñu ñu lim seeni tur, dikk fa ca jamonoy Esekiyas buurub Yuda; daldi yàq xayma yi ak mbaari sëti Xam yooyu, faagaagal leen, ba ñu jeex tàkk ba tey jii. Ba loolu amee ñu wuutu leen fa ndax parlu ma ñu fa amal seeni gàtt.<verse eid="1CH 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42" />Amoon na it juróomi téeméeri nit ñu bokk ci askanu Simeyon ñu jàll ba ca diiwaanu tundi Seyir, ci njiital ñeenti doomi Yisey yu góor ya, di Pelaca ak Neyarya ak Refaya ak Usyel.<verse eid="1CH 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43" />Ba mu ko defee ñu rey ña desoon ca Amalegeen ña, dëkk fa nag booba ba bésub tey jii.<verse eid="1CH 4:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Ruben, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1" />Ruben moo doon taawub Israayil bu góor. Waaye gannaaw ba mu tëddee soxnas baayam, cér ba mu yelloo woon ndax la muy taaw, dañu koo féetale doomi góor ñi Yuusufa doomu Israayil, di seen baay. Taxul nag ñu bind Ruben, ba def ko mu dib taaw ci limu cosaan yi. <verse eid="1CH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2" />Yuda it ku amoon doole la ci biiri bokkam, te ci moom la buurub Israayil soqikoo. Waaye terewul céru taaw ba féeteek Yuusufa.<verse eid="1CH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3" />Góor ñi Ruben, taawub Israayil, di seen baay ñoo di Enog ak Palu ak Esron ak Karmi. <verse eid="1CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Yowel ñoo di Semaya mi jur Gog mu jur Simey. <verse eid="1CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5" />Simey moo jur Mise mi jur Reyaya mu jur Baal. <verse eid="1CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6" />Baal moo jur Beera kilifag giiri Ruben ga Tiglaat Pilser buurub Asiri jàppoon, yóbbu réewam. <verse eid="1CH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7" />Bokki Bera ya doon ay kilifa ca seeni làng, bindoon nañu leen ca limeef ya. Ka ca jiitu di Yewel, Sàkkaryaa topp ca. <verse eid="1CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8" />Ka ca topp nag di Bela, ku góor ka Asas di baayam, te Sema di maamam ju góor yi Yowel di baayam. Ña nga dëkkoon ca diiwaan ba ca diggante Arower ak Nebo ak Baal Mewon. <verse eid="1CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9" />Ca wetu penku dëkke woon nañu ko ba fa leru màndiŋ ma xàjjale woon seen suuf ak dexu Efraat. Ndax nag dañoo bare woon ag jur ca diiwaanu Galàdd googu. <verse eid="1CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10" />Ca jamonoy Sawul giirug Ruben googu xare nañook Agareen ña, ba duma leen, daldi dëkke seen xayma ca mboolem diiwaan ya féete Galàdd penku.<verse eid="1CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Gàdd, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11" />Ñi askanoo ci Gàdd a nga dëkkoon fa janook ñoom ca diiwaanu Basan ba ca Salka. <verse eid="1CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12" />Làng ga ca jiitu woon moo doon yu Yowel, ga ca topp di gu Safam, ga ca toppaat di gu Yanay, ak Safat ca Basan.<verse eid="1CH 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13" />Ñu feggook seeni bokk yu def juróom ñaari làng, muy làngug Mikayel ak làngug Mesulam ak làngug Seba ak làngu Yoray ak làngu Yakan ak làngu Siya ak làngu Eber. <verse eid="1CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14" />Ñi sos làng yooyu nag ñoo di doomi Abixayil yu góor; seen maam yu góor di Uri, ak Yarowax mi jur Uri, ak Galàdd mi jur Yarowax, ak Mikayel mi jur Galàdd, ak Yesisay mi jur Mikayel, ak Yado mi jur Yesisay, ak Bus mi jur Yado. <verse eid="1CH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15" />Axi, ku góor kay doomu Abdiyel, di sëtub Gunni moo doon kilifag làng yooyu. <verse eid="1CH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16" />Askanu Gàdd nag ñoo dëkke woon mboolem diiwaanu Galàdd ak Basan ak gox ya ca bokk, boole ca parluy Saron, ba fa mu yem.<verse eid="1CH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17" />Ñi bokk ci làng yooyu yépp limees na leen na ñu cosaanoo, ca janti Yotam buurub Yuda ak Yerbowam buurub Israayil.<verse eid="1CH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18" />Waa giiri Ruben ak gu Gàdd ak genn-wàllu giirug Manase amoon nañu ay jàmbaar, ñu mane pakk ak saamar ak xalaaki fitt, boole ci tàggatu ngir xare, ñépp tollu ci ñeent fukki junni ak ñeent ak juróom ñaari téeméer ak juróom benn fukk (44 760), di ñu tollu ci xare. <verse eid="1CH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19" />Ñu xareek Agareen ña ak askanu Yetur ak askanu Nafis ak askanu Nodab. <verse eid="1CH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20" />Ca biir xare ba nag ñu woo Yàlla wall. Yàlla nangul leen ndax kóolute gu ñu amoon ci moom, mu wallu leen ba ñu duma Agareen ña ak mboolem ña àndoon ak ñoom. <verse eid="1CH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21" />Ñu nangu seenug jur, muy juróom fukki junniy (50 000) giléem, ak ñaari téeméeri junni ak juróom fukki (250 000) gàtt, ak ñaari junniy (2 000) mbaam, jàpp ca téeméeri junniy (100 000) nit. <verse eid="1CH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22" />Rey nañu ca ñu baree bare, ndax Yàllaa yoroon xare ba. Ñu wuutu nag Agareen ña ca seen suuf, ba keroog ñu yóbbu <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> réewum jàmbur.<verse eid="1CH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu genn-wàllu giirug Manase, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23" />Genn-wàllu giirug Manase gaa nga dëkke woon fa dale Basan ba ca Baal Ermon ca Senir ak tundu Ermon. Ñu giiroon lañu. <verse eid="1CH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24" />Ña yilifoon seen këri maam ca ñoom ñoo di Efer ak Yisey ak Elyel ak Asriyel ak Yeremi ak Odawya ak Yadiyel. Kilifay kër yooyu ay ñeyi xare lañu woon, di ay nit ñu siiw. <verse eid="1CH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25" />Waaye gannaaw gi waa giir yooyu fecci worma seen digganteek seen Yàllay maam, di bokkaaleek yàllay waa réew mi leen Yàlla reyaloon. <verse eid="1CH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26" />Ci kaw loolu Israayil xabtal Pul buurub Asiri, di Tiglaat Pilser buurub Asiri, xiir ko ci song réewum giirug Ruben ak Gàdd ak genn-wàllu giirug Manase, jàpp leen, toxal ca diiwaani Ala ak Abor ak Ara ak ca wetu dexu Gosan. Ñu daldi fay des ba bésub tey jii.<verse eid="1CH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Lewi, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 5:27" />Doomi Lewi yu góor ñoo di Gerson ak Keyat ak Merari. <verse eid="1CH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 5:28" />Doomi Keyat yu góor ñoo di Amram ak Iccar ak Ebron ak Usyel. <verse eid="1CH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 5:29" />Doomi Amram yu góor ñoo di Aaróona ak Musaa, Maryaama di doomam yu jigéen. Doomi Aaróona yu góor ñoo di Nadab ak Abiyu ak Elasar ak Itamar. <verse eid="1CH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 5:30" />Elasar mooy baayu Fineyas, Fineyas di baayu Abiswa. <verse eid="1CH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 5:31" />Abiswa mooy baayu Bukki, Bukki di baayu Usi. <verse eid="1CH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 5:32" />Usi mooy baayu Seraxya, Seraxya di baayu Merayot. <verse eid="1CH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 5:33" />Merayot mooy baayu Amarya, Amarya di baayu Axitub. <verse eid="1CH 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 5:34" />Axitub mooy baayu Cadog, Cadog di baayu Aximàcc. <verse eid="1CH 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 5:35" />Aximàcc mooy baayu Asaryaa di baayu Yoxanan. <verse eid="1CH 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 5:36" />Yoxanan mooy baayu Asaryaa. Asaryaa moomu <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> la woon ca kër Yàlla ga Suleymaan tabaxoon ca Yerusalem. <verse eid="1CH 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 5:37" />Asaryaa mooy baayu Amarya, Amarya di baayu Axitub. <verse eid="1CH 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 5:38" />Axitub mooy baayu Cadog, Cadog di baayu Salum. <verse eid="1CH 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 5:39" />Salum mooy baayu Ilkiya, Ilkiya di baayu Asaryaa. <verse eid="1CH 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 5:40" />Asaryaa mooy baayu Seraya, Seraya di baayu Yoccadag. <verse eid="1CH 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 5:41" />Yoccadag moomu gàddaayloo nañu ko ca jamono ja Aji Sax ji toxal waa Yuda ak Yerusalem, jaarale ko ci Nebukatnecar.<verse eid="1CH 5:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1" />Doomi Lewi yu góor di Gerson, Keyat ak Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2" />Ñii ñoo di doomi Gerson yu góor: Libni ak Simey. <verse eid="1CH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3" />Doomi Keyat yu góor ñoo di Amram ak Iccar ak Ebron ak Usyel. <verse eid="1CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4" />Doomi Merari yu góor ñoo di Maxli ak Musi. Ñooñu ñooy ñi ñu tudde làngi giirug <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ñi ni leen seeni maam lime.<verse eid="1CH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Gerson ñoo di doomam Libni mi jur Yaxat mu jur Simma. <verse eid="1CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6" />Simma moo jur Yowax mi jur Ido mu jur Sera ak Yettray.<verse eid="1CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Keyat ñoo di Aminadab mi jur Kore mu jur Asir. <verse eid="1CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8" />Asir jur Elkana mi jur Abyasaf mu jur Asir. <verse eid="1CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9" />Asir moomu jur Taxat mi jur Uryel mu jur Osiyas mu jur Sawul. <verse eid="1CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10" />Elkana am na yeneen doom yu góor, ñuy Amasay ak Aximot. <verse eid="1CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11" />Góor ñi soqikoo ci Elkana ñoo di Cofay mi jur Naxat. <verse eid="1CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12" />Naxat jur Elyab mu jur Yeroxam mi jur Elkana. <verse eid="1CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13" />Doomi Samiyel yu góor ñoo di Yowel taawam, ka ca topp di Abya. <verse eid="1CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14" />Góor ñi soqikoo ci Merari nii lañu toppantee: Maxli mi jur Libni mu jur Simey mu jur Usa. <verse eid="1CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15" />Usa jur Simeya mi jur Agiya mu jur Asaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawuda sas na woykat yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16" />Ñii ñoo di <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ñi Daawuda sasoon ñuy jiite woy yi ci kër Aji Sax ji, bu ñu fa xasee yeb <char style="w" lemma="gaalu kóllëre g-:">gaalu Yàlla</char> ga. <verse eid="1CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17" />Ñooñu ñoo yoroon liggéeyu woy ya fa kanam jaamookaay ba, ca <char style="w" lemma="xaymab ndaje m-:">xaymab ndaje</char> ma, ba keroog Suleymaan tabaxee kër Aji Sax ji ca Yerusalem. Ñuy def seen liggéey nag na ñu leen ko sante.<verse eid="1CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18" />Ñi sasoo woon liggéey boobu ñook seeni doom yu góor ñii la: làngu Keyat: Eman woykat ba, doomu Yowel, doomu Samiyel, <verse eid="1CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19" />doomu Elkana, doomu Yeroxam, doomu Elyel, doomu Towa, <verse eid="1CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20" />doomu Cuuf, doomu Elkana, doomu Maxat, doomu Amasay, <verse eid="1CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21" />doomu Elkana, doomu Yowel, doomu Asaryaa, doomu Sofoni, <verse eid="1CH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22" />doomu Taxat, doomu Asir, doomu Abyasaf, doomu Kore, <verse eid="1CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23" />doomu Iccar, doomu Keyat, doomu Lewi, doomu Israayil.<verse eid="1CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24" />Ku góor ka daan taxaw ca wetu ndijooru Eman ca liggéey ba moo doon mbokkam Asaf. Asaf moo doon doomu Berekya, doomu Simeya, <verse eid="1CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25" />doomu Mikayel, doomu Baaseya, doomu Malkiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26" />doomu Etni, doomu Sera, doomu Adaya, <verse eid="1CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27" />doomu Etan, doomu Simma, doomu Simey, <verse eid="1CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28" />doomu Yaxat, doomu Gerson, doomu Lewi.<verse eid="1CH 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29" />Waa làngi Merari ñoo daan féete càmmoñ: Etan doomu Kisi, doomu Abdi, doomu Malukk, <verse eid="1CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30" />doomu Asabya, doomu Amaciya, doomu Ilkiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31" />doomu Amci, doomu Bani, doomu Semer, <verse eid="1CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32" />doomu Maxli, doomu Musi, doomu Merari, doomu Lewi.<verse eid="1CH 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33" />Seen yeneen mbokki Leween ñi ñoo doon def mboolem yeneen liggéeyi kër Yàlla ga.<verse eid="1CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñii ñooy askanu Aaróona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34" />Waaye Aaróona ak góor ñi askanoo ci moom ñoo doon lakk sarax yi ci kaw <char style="w" lemma="sarxalukaay b-:">sarxalukaayu rendi-dóomal</char> yi, di taal <char style="w" lemma="cuuraay l-:">cuuraay</char> li ci kaw sarxalukaayu cuuraay ba, di toppatoo mboolem lu jëm ci <char style="w" lemma="néeg bu sell b-:">néeg bu sella sell</char> ba. Ba tey ñoo doon daa defal Israayil seen njotlaay, na ko Musaa, jaamu Yàlla ba digle woon.<verse eid="1CH 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Aaróona nii lañu toppantee: Elasar doomu Aaróona, moo jur Fineyas mi jur Abiswa. <verse eid="1CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36" />Abiswa moo jur Bukki mi jur Usi mu jur Seraxya. <verse eid="1CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37" />Seraxya moo jur Merayot mi jur Amarya mu jur Axitub. <verse eid="1CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38" />Axitub moo jur Cadog mu jur Aximàcc.<verse eid="1CH 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lu jëm ci suufu Leween ña</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39" />Gox yii ñuy lim la askanu Aaróona wi bokk ci làngu Keyat dëkke woon. Ñoo njëkka jot ca seen suuf sa ñu muurloo ci kaw tegoo bant. <verse eid="1CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40" />Jox nañu leen Ebron, dëkk bu mag ba ca Yuda ak àlli parlu ya ko wër. <verse eid="1CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41" />Waaye fekk na tool yaak dëkk yu ndaw ya bokk ca dëkk bu mag ba, jox nañu ko Kaleb, ku góor kay doomu Yefune. <verse eid="1CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Aaróona lañu jox Ebron, dëkkub rawtu ba, ak Libna ak àlli parlu ya ko wër, ak Yatir ak Estemowa ak parlu ya ko wër; <verse eid="1CH 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43" />ak Ilen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.43 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ilen </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy Iles ba tey.</char></note> ak parlu ya ko wër, ak Debir ak parlu ya ko wër; <verse eid="1CH 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44" />ak Asan ak parlu ya ko wër, ak Bet Semes ak parlu ya ko wër. <verse eid="1CH 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45" />Jële nañu ci suufas giirug Beñamin dëkk ba ñuy wax Geba aki parloom, ak Alemet aki parloom, ak Anatot aki parloom. Lépp di fukki dëkk ak ñett yu ñu séddoo ci seeni làng.<verse eid="1CH 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46" />Waa kër góor ña des ci askanu Keyat lañu jox fukki dëkk yu bokk ci suufas giirug Efrayim ak giirug Dan ak genn-wàllu giirug Manase. <verse eid="1CH 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47" />Waa kër góor ñi askanoo ci Gerson lañu jox fukki dëkk yu mag ak ñett yu bokk ci suufi giiri Isaakar ak Aser ak Neftali ak genn-wàllu giirug Manase ga dëkke diiwaanu Basan. <verse eid="1CH 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Merari la seen làng muurloo ci tegoo bant fukki dëkk yu mag ak ñaar yu bokk ci suufi giiri Ruben ak Gàdd ak Sabulon. <verse eid="1CH 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49" />Noonu la <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> joxe <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ñi dëkk yooyu ak seeni parlu. <verse eid="1CH 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50" />Dëkk yooyu bokk ci suufi Yuda ak Simeyon ak Beñamin, di dëkk yi ñu jota lim seeni tur ci kaw, ab tegoo bant lañu leen joxe. <verse eid="1CH 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51" />Lenn ci kër yu bokk ci làngi Keyat lañu jox dëkk yu mag yii bokk ci suufi giirug Efrayim: <verse eid="1CH 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52" />ca diiwaanu tundi Efrayim, Sikem dëkku rawtu ba ak parloom; ak Geser ak parloom; <verse eid="1CH 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53" />ak Yogmeyam ak parloom; ak Bet Oron ak parloom; <verse eid="1CH 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54" />ak Ayalon ak parloom; ak Gaat Rimon ak parloom. <verse eid="1CH 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55" />Ñu ame ba tey ca suufas genn-wàllu giirug Manase dëkk yii ànd ak seeni parlu: Aner ak Bileyam. Làngi yeneen doomi Keyat a ko séddoo.<verse eid="1CH 6:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Gerson lañu jox lii: ci céru genn-wàllu giirug Manase lañu leen sédde dëkk yu mag yii ànd ak seeni parlu: di Golan ci diiwaanu Basan, ak Astarot, <verse eid="1CH 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57" />joxaat leen ci suufas giirug Isaakar dëkk yii ànd ak seeni parlu: di Kedes ak Dabraat <verse eid="1CH 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58" />ak Ramot ak Anem. <verse eid="1CH 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59" />Ñu dellu jox leen ci suufas giirug Aser dëkk yii ànd ak seeni parlu: di Masal ak Abdon <verse eid="1CH 6:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60" />ak Ukog ak Rexob. <verse eid="1CH 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61" />Ñu dellooti jox leen ci suufas giirug Neftali dëkk ba ñuy wax Kedes ca Galile ak àllub parlu ya ko wër, ak Amon ak parlu ya ko wër, ak Kiryaatayim aki parloom.<verse eid="1CH 6:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Merari, muy ña des ca Leween ña, ñoom lañu jox suuf sa ñu jële ca suufas giirug Sabulon. Dëkk yii la ak seeni parlu: Rimono ak Tabor. <verse eid="1CH 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63" />Ñu joxaat leen dëkk ya ca wàllaa dexu Yurdan ca penkub Yeriko, te bokk ca suufas giirug Ruben. Mooy dëkk yii ànd ak seeni parlu: di Beccer ga ca ndànd-foyfoy ga ak Yaxacc <verse eid="1CH 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64" />ak Kedemot ak Mefaat. <verse eid="1CH 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65" />Ñu joxati leen ci suufas giiru Gàdd, dëkk yii ak seeni parlu: di Ramot ga ca Galàdd, ak Maxanayim <verse eid="1CH 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66" />ak Esbon ak Yaser.<verse eid="1CH 6:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7" />
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Isaakar, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1" />Isaakar amoon na ñeenti doom yu góor: Tola ak Puwa ak Yasub ak Simron. <verse eid="1CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2" />Doomi Tola yu góor ñoo di Usi ak Refaya ak Yeryel ak Yaxmay ak Ibsam ak Samiyel. Ñooñoo soqeekoo ci Tola, jiite seeni kër baay, di ay ñeyi xare ca seen biiri bokk. Ca jamonoy Daawuda waa askanu Tola ñu ngi tollu woon ci ñaar fukki junneek ñaar ak juróom benni téeméer (22 600). <verse eid="1CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3" />Doomu Usi ju góor moo di Israxya. Israxya ak doomam yu góor, di Mikayel ak Abdiyas ak Yowel ak Isiya, ñoom juróom ñépp ay kilifa lañu woon. <verse eid="1CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4" />Ñoom ci seen biir askan, làng ak làng amoon nañu fanweeri junni ak juróom benni (36 000) xarekat yu jekk ci xare, ndax amoon nañu jabar yu bare ak doom yu góor yu bare. <verse eid="1CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5" />Mboolem ñeneen ñi bokk ci làngi Isaakar te diy ñeyi xare yu ñu bind ci limeef yi, juróom ñett fukki junni lañu woon ak juróom ñaar (87 000).<verse eid="1CH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Beñamin, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6" />Doomi Beñamin yu góor ñoo di Bela, Beker ak Yediyel, ñuy ñett. <verse eid="1CH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7" />Doomi Bela yu góor ñoo di Eccbon ak Usi ak Usyel ak Yerimot ak Iri, ñuy juróomi ñeyi xare yu jiite seeni kër baay, ñu bind leen ci limeef yi, ñoom ñépp di ñaar fukki junneek ñaar yu topp fanweer ak ñeent (22 034). <verse eid="1CH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8" />Doomi Beker yu góor ñoo di Semira ak Yowas ak Elyeser ak Elyonay ak Omri ak Yeremot ak Abya ak Anatot ak Alemet; ñoom ñépp di doomi Beker yu góor.<verse eid="1CH 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9" />Ña doonoon ay ñeyi xare, jiite seeni kër baay ya ñu bind ca limeef ya, ñuy ñaar fukki junni ak ñaari téeméer (20 200). <verse eid="1CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10" />Doomu Yediyel ju góor di Bilan mi jur Yewus ak Beñamin ak Ewudd ak Kenaana ak Setan ak Tarsis ak Axisaxaar. <verse eid="1CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11" />Mboolem ñooñu soqeekoo ci Yediyel di ay ñeyi xare yu jiite seeni kër baay, fukki junniy nit ak juróom ñaar ak ñaari téeméer (17 200) lañu woon, ñépp tollu ci xare. <verse eid="1CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12" />Suppim ak Uppim doomi Ir yu góor lañu woon, Usim di doomu Axer ju góor.<verse eid="1CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Neftali, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13" />Doomi Neftali yu góor ñoo di Yàcceel ak Gunni ak Yeccer ak Salum, yaayu Neftali di Bilaa.<verse eid="1CH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Manase, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14" />Doomi Manase yu góor ñoo di Asriyel ak Makir, ña mu am ak nekkaaleem ba doon waa Siri. Makir mooy baayu Galàdd. <verse eid="1CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15" />Makir moomu moo takkal Uppim soxna, takkal Suppim soxna. Amoon na ab jigéen bu ñuy wax Maaka. Makir amaat doom ju góor ju ñuy wax Celofat, waaye Celofat amul lu moy doom yu jigéen. <verse eid="1CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16" />Maaka, soxnas Makir amaat ak Makir doom ju góor, tudde ko Peres, amati jeneen doom ju góor, tudde ko Seres. Seres mooy baayu Ulam ak Rekem. <verse eid="1CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17" />Ulam mooy baayu Bedan. Ñooñooy góor ñi soqikoo ci Galàdd, di doomu Makir ak sëtu Manase. <verse eid="1CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18" />Amoleket, jigéenub Galàdd, moo jur Isod ak Abiyeser ak Maxla. <verse eid="1CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19" />Doomi Semida yu góor ñoo doon Axyan ak Sikem ak Liki ak Añam.<verse eid="1CH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Efrayim, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Efrayim nii lañu toppantee: Efrayim a jur Sutelax mi jur Beredd mu jur Taxat mi jur Elada mu jur Taxat. <verse eid="1CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21" />Taxat moo jur Sabàdd mi jur Sutelax. Eser ak Elat la waa Gaat ña fa juddoo rey, ba ñu fa demee bëgga nangu seenug jur. <verse eid="1CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22" />Seen baay Efrayim jooy na leen lu yàgg, ay bokkam dikk, di ko dëfal. <verse eid="1CH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23" />Gannaaw gi, Efrayim ànd ak soxnaam, am ak moom doom ju góor, tudde ko Berya (muy firi Digg njàqare) ngir njàqare la dal njaboot ga. <verse eid="1CH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24" />Efrayim am na doom ju jigéen ju ñuy wax Seera. Moo tabax Bet Oron Suuf ak Bet Oron Kaw ak Usen Seera. <verse eid="1CH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25" />Góor ñi askanoo ci Berya nii lañu toppantee: Refa moo jur Resef mi jur Tela mu jur Taxan. <verse eid="1CH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26" />Taxan moo jur Ladan mi jur Amiyudd mi jur Elisama. <verse eid="1CH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27" />Elisama moo jur Nuun mi jur Yosuwe.<verse eid="1CH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28" />Suuf sa giirug Efrayim moomoon, dëkke ko, Betel bokk na ci ak dëkk yu ndaw ya ko wër, ak Naaran ca penku, ak Geser ak dëkk yu ndaw ya ko wër, ca sowu, boole ca diiwaan ba ca diggante Sikem ak Aya ak dëkk yu ndaw yi ko wër. <verse eid="1CH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29" />Ñi askanoo ci Manase ñoo moomoon dëkk yu ñuy wax Bet San ak Taanag ak Megido ak Dor, dëkk bu ci nekk ak dëkk yu ndaw ya ko wër. Ci dëkk yooyu la waa askanu Yuusufa doomu Yanqóoba dëkke woon.<verse eid="1CH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Aser, doomu Yanqóoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30" />Doomi Aser yu góor ñoo di Imna ak Yiswa ak Iswi ak Berya, seenub jigéen di Sera. <verse eid="1CH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31" />Doomi Berya yu góor ñoo di Eber ak Malkiyel. Malkiyel moo sanc Birsayit. <verse eid="1CH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32" />Eber mooy baayu Yaflet ak Somer ak Otam ak seenub jigéen Suwa. <verse eid="1CH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33" />Doomi Yaflet yu góor ñoo di Pasag ak Bimal ak Asewat. <verse eid="1CH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34" />Doomi Semer yu góor ñoo di Axi ak Roga ak Uba ak Aram. <verse eid="1CH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35" />Góor ñi bokkam Elem di seen baay ñoo di Cofax ak Imna ak Seles ak Amal. <verse eid="1CH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36" />Doomi Cofax yu góor ñoo di Suwa ak Arnefer ak Suwal ak Beri ak Imra. <verse eid="1CH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37" />Beccer bokk na ci, ak Odd ak Sama ak Silesa ak Yittran ak Beera. <verse eid="1CH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38" />Doomi Yeter yu góor ñoo di Yefune ak Pispa ak Ara. <verse eid="1CH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39" />Doomi Ula yu góor ñoo di Ara ak Aniyel ak Ricciya.<verse eid="1CH 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40" />Ñooñu ñépp ñu ngi soqikoo ci Aser, di kilifa yu tekki ca seeni kër baay, di ñeyi xare te di njiit yu ñu ràññee. Góor ña ca bindu ca limeef ya te tollu ci xare, ñaar fukk ak juróom benn junni lañu (26 000).<verse eid="1CH 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Lii mooy askanu Sawul, mu giiru Beñamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1" />Beñamin mooy baayu Bela miy taawam bu góor. Ku góor ka ca topp di Asbel, Aara di ñetteelu doomam ju góor. <verse eid="1CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2" />Noxa di ñeenteelu doomam ju góor, Rafa di juróomeelu doomam ju góor. <verse eid="1CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3" />Doomi Bela yu góor ñoo di Adar ak Gera ak Abiyudd. <verse eid="1CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4" />Abiswa ca la ak Naaman ak Axowa. <verse eid="1CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5" />Gera it ca la ak Sefufan ak Uram.<verse eid="1CH 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6-7" />Doomi Exudd yu góor yooyu di Naaman ak Axya ak Gera. Ñoo doon kilifay làngu waa Geba ya ñu toxal Manaxat, te Gera moo leen toxal. Mooy baayu Usa ak Axixudd.<verse eid="1CH 8:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8" />Saxarayim, gannaaw ba mu fasee Usim ak Baara ñaari soxnaam ya, am na ay doom yu góor ca réewam Mowab. <verse eid="1CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9" />Moo jël Odes soxna, am ca Yobab ak Cibya ak Mesa ak Malkam. <verse eid="1CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10" />Am na ca it Yewucc ak Sakiya ak Mirma. Doomam yu góor yooyu mujj jiite seen kër baay.<verse eid="1CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11" />Fekk na mu am ak Usim ñaari doom yu góor, Abitub ak Elpaal. <verse eid="1CH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12" />Doomi Elpaal yu góor ñoo di Eber ak Misam ak Semedd. Semedd moomu moo tabax dëkk ya ñuy wax Ono ak Lodd ak dëkk yu ndaw ya ko wër. <verse eid="1CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13" />Berya ak Sema ay kilifay làngi waa Ayalon lañu woon. Ñoo dàq waa Gaat. <verse eid="1CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14" />Ñii di Axyo ak Sasag ak Yeremot <verse eid="1CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15" />ak Sebaja ak Aràdd ak Eder <verse eid="1CH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16" />ak Mikayel ak Ispa ak Yoxa, ñooy góor ñi Berya di seen baay. <verse eid="1CH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17" />Sebaja nag mook Mesulam ak Iski ak Eber, <verse eid="1CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18" />ak Ismeray ak Isliya ak Yobab ñooy góor ñi Elpaal di seen baay. <verse eid="1CH 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19" />Yakim ak Sikkri ak Sabdi <verse eid="1CH 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20" />ak Eliyenay ak Ciletay ak Elyel <verse eid="1CH 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21" />ak Adaya ak Beraya ak Simrat ñooy góor yi Simey di seen baay. <verse eid="1CH 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22" />Ispan nag mook Eber ak Elyel <verse eid="1CH 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23" />ak Abdon ak Sikkri ak Xanan <verse eid="1CH 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24" />ak Anaña ak Elam ak Anatoca <verse eid="1CH 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25" />ak Ifdeya ak Penuwel, ñooy góor ñi Sasag di seen baay. <verse eid="1CH 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26" />Samseray ak Sexarya ak Atalyaa <verse eid="1CH 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27" />ak Yaaresya ak Elya ak Sikkri, ñooy góor ñi Yeroxam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yeroxam </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy Yeremot ba tey. Seetal ci aaya 14 (8.14).</char></note> di seen baay.<verse eid="1CH 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28" />Ñooñoo jiite woon seeni waa këri maam, ku nekk ak sag maas. Ña nga dëkkoon Yerusalem.<verse eid="1CH 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29" />Baayu Gabawon, Gabawon la dëkkoon. Maaka la soxnaam tudd. <verse eid="1CH 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30" />Taawam bu góor moo doon Abdon, góor ña ca topp di Cur ak Kis ak Baal ak Ner ak Nadab, <verse eid="1CH 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31" />ak Gedor ak Axyo ak Seker<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.31 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Seker </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ak Sàkkaryaa, kenn ki la. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">1.Jaar-jaar ya</char> 9.37.</note> <verse eid="1CH 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32" />ak Miglot baayu Simeyam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.32 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Simeyam </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy Simeya ba tey. Seetal ci 9.38.</char></note>. Ñooñu itam ña nga dëkkoon Yerusalem ñook seeni bokk. <verse eid="1CH 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33" />Ner mooy baayu Kis, Kis di baayu Sawul, Sawul di baayu Yonatan ak Malkisuwa ak Abinadab ak Esbaal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.33 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Esbaal </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy Isboset ba tey. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">2.Samiyel</char> 2.8.</note>. <verse eid="1CH 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34" />Doomu Yonatan ju góor moo di Meribaal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.34</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Meribaal </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy Mefiboset ba tey. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">2.Samiyel 4.4</char>; <char style="bk">1.Jaar-jaar ya</char> 9.40.</note>; Meribaal di baayu Mise. <verse eid="1CH 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35" />Doomi Mise yu góor ñoo di Piton ak Meleg ak Tareya ak Axas. <verse eid="1CH 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36" />Axas mooy baayu Yowada, Yowada di baayu Alemet ak Asmawet ak Simri; Simri di baayu Mocca. <verse eid="1CH 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37" />Mocca mooy baayu Bineya. Bineya di baayu Rafa, Rafa di baayu Elasa, Elasa di baayu Accel. <verse eid="1CH 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38" />Accel amoon na juróom benni doom yu góor, ñuy Asrikam ak Bokkru ak Ismayel ak Seyarya ak Abdiyas ak Xanan. Ñooñu ñépp Accel moo leen jur.<verse eid="1CH 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39" />Eseg la Accel bokkal. Góor ñi Eseg di seen baay ñoo di Ulam, taawam, Yewus topp ca, Elifelet toppaat ca. <verse eid="1CH 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40" />Doomi Ulam yu góor nag ay ñeyi xare lañu woon, diy fittkat. Amoon nañu ay doom yu góor ak sët yu góor yu takku, ñoom ñépp di téeméer ak juróom fukk (150).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 8:40">Ñooñu ñépp ci Beñamin lañu soqikoo.<verse eid="1CH 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Askanu Israayil wi ci Yerusalem, gannaaw seen ngàlloo ngi nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1" />Noonu lañu binde woon Israayil gépp ci seen limeefi maam. Ci téereb buuri Israayil lañu ko tënk.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1CH 9:1">Waa Yerusalem ñibbisi nañu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:1">Waa Yuda ñoom dees leena gàddaayloo Babilon ndax li ñu fecci seen kóllëre ak Yàlla. <verse eid="1CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2" />Ña njëkka ñibbi seen dëkk, ba jotaat seen alal moo di niti <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> yi sasoowul diine, ak <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> ya ak <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ña, ak ñu féetewoo liggéey yu sew ya ca kër Yàlla ga. <verse eid="1CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3" />Amoon na góori Yuda ak Beñamin ak Efrayim ak Manase ñu dëkksi Yerusalem.<verse eid="1CH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4" />Ña bàyyikoo ca giiru Yuda: Utay, doomu Amiyudd, doomu Omri, doomu Imri, doomu Bani mi askanoo ci Peres doomu Yuda. <verse eid="1CH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5" />Ña bàyyikoo ca Sela doomu Yuda nag: Asaya, di taawub waa këram ak ay doomam yu góor. <verse eid="1CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6" />Ña bàyyikoo ca làngu Sera doomu Yuda nag: Yewel. Waa Yuda juróom benni téeméer ak juróom ñeent fukk (690) lañu woon. <verse eid="1CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7" />Ña bàyyikoo ci giirug Beñamin: Salu, doomu Mesulam, doomu Odawya, doomu Asenuwa; <verse eid="1CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8" />Ibneya, doomu Yeroxam; Ela, doomu Usi, doomu Mikkri; Mesulam doomu Sefatiya, doomu Rewel, doomu Ibniya.<verse eid="1CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9" />Ñooñu ñépp ay kilifa lañu woon ca seeni bokk, ku nekk ca waa këram. Waa giirug Beñamin ya dëkkoon Yerusalem juróom ñeenti téeméer ak juróom fukk ak juróom benn (956) lañu woon.<verse eid="1CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10" />Ña bàyyikoo ca sarxalkat ya ñii la: Yedaya ak Yoyarib ak Yakin; <verse eid="1CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11" />Asaryaa it ca la. Asaryaa, Ilkiya mooy baayam; Ilkiya, Mesulam ay baayam; Mesulam, Cadog ay baayam; Cadog, Merayot ay baayam; Merayot, Axitub ma yoroon kër Yàlla ga mooy baayam. <verse eid="1CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12" />Adaya it ca la. Adaya, Yeroxam ay baayam; Yeroxam, Pasur ay baayam; Pasur, Malkiya mooy baayam; Malkiya, Masay mooy baayam; Masay, Adiyel ay baayam; Adiyel, Yaxsera mooy baayam; Yaxsera, Mesulam ay baayam; Mesulam, Mesilemit ay baayam; Mesilemit, Imer mooy baayam. <verse eid="1CH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13" />Ñook seeni bokk nag ay kilifa lañu woon ca seen kër baay, tollu ci junni ak juróom ñaari téeméer ak juróom benn fukk (1 760), di góor ñu jàmbaare, féetewoo liggéeyu kër Yàlla gi.<verse eid="1CH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14" />Ña bàyyikoo ci Leween ñi, ñii la: Semaya, Asub ay baayam; Asub, Asrikam ay baayam; Asrikam, Asabya mi askanoo ci Merari mooy baayam; <verse eid="1CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15" />ak itam Bagbakar ak Eres ak Galal ak Mataña; Mataña, Mise mooy baayam; Mise, Sikkri mooy baayam; Sikkri, Asaf mooy baayam; <verse eid="1CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16" />ak Abdiyas, Semaya di baayam; Semaya, Galal mooy baayam; Galal, Yedutun ay baayam. Ak itam Berekya; Berekya, Asa mooy baayam; Asa, Elkana mooy baayam. Berekya moo dëkkoon ca dëkki waa Netofa.<verse eid="1CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17" />Ci wàllu wattukati bunt ya, Salum bokkoon na ca, mooki bokkam di Akub ak Talmon ak Aximan. Salum a doon seen njiit. <verse eid="1CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18" />Ba tey jii mooy taxaw ca buntu Buur, ba féete penku. Ñoom ñooy wattukati bunt yi ci dali Leween ñi. <verse eid="1CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19" />Salum, Kore mooy baayam; Kore, Abyasaf mooy baayam; Abyasaf, Kore mooy baayam. Salum moomu mook bokkam yi soqikoo ci waa kër Kore, ñoo doon wattukati buntu <char style="w" lemma="xaymab ndaje m-:">xaymab ndaje</char> ma, topp ca seen tànki maam ya daan wattu dalub Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20" />Fineyas ma Elasar di baayam masoon naa nekk seen njiit, ndax ku Aji Sax ji àndoon ak moom la. <verse eid="1CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21" />Ku ñuy wax Sàkkaryaa doomu Meselemya bokkoon na ci wattukati buntu xaymab ndaje ma.<verse eid="1CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22" />Mboolem ñi ñu tànnoon ñu diy wattukati bunt, ñaari téeméer lañu ak fukk ak ñaar (212), ñu bind leen ca seeni dëkk. Daawuda ak Samiyel boroom gis, ñoo leen dénkoon loolu ndax kóolute. <verse eid="1CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23" />Ñoom ak seeni askan lañu tegoon ca kër Aji Sax ji, ñuy wattu ca këru xayma ba. <verse eid="1CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24" />Ñeenti wet yépp amoon na ay wattukat; penku ak sowu, bëj-gànnaar ak bëj-saalum. <verse eid="1CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25" />Yeneen wattukati bunt nag wara jóge seeni dëkk léeg-léeg, dikk, ngir jàppale leen ci wattu bi, diirub ayu bés. <verse eid="1CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26" />Ñeenti kilifay wattukati bunt yooyu diy Leween, dañu daan dëkke wattu te ñoo daan sàmm néegi kër Yàlla ga aki dencam. <verse eid="1CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27" />Ña nga daan fanaan fa, wër kër Yàlla ga, ndax ñoo ko daan sàmm, di ubbi bunt ya suba su nekk.<verse eid="1CH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28" />Amoon na ñenn ci ñoom ñu yoroon ndabi jumtukaayi kër Yàlla ga; di ko waññ, bu ñu koy dugal ak bu ñu koy génne. <verse eid="1CH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29" />Mu am ñeneen ba tey ñu sasoo ndab yi, muy ndabi jaamookaay bi yépp, boole ci sunguf su mucc ayib si ak biiñ bi ak diw gi ak <char style="w" lemma="cuuraay l-:">cuuraay</char> li ak ndàbb ya. <verse eid="1CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30" />Am na ñenn ci sarxalkat yi ñu daan njafaan ndàbb yu xeeñ yi. <verse eid="1CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31" />Ab Leween bu ñuy wax Matica, ku góor kay taawub Salum mi bokk ci làngu Kore, moom lañu dénkoon ñuy lakk mburum sarax sa. <verse eid="1CH 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32" />Mu am nag yeneen Leween yu bokk ci làngu Keyat yu warloo woona waajal mburu yu <char style="w" lemma="sell:">sell</char> yu ñuy sarxalal Yàlla <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bésub Noflaay</char> bu nekk.<verse eid="1CH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33" />Woykati Leween ñi jiite seeni waa kër nag, dañoo amoon seen néegi bopp te amuloon beneen sas bu leen waroon ndax dañu daan liggéey guddeek bëccëg.<verse eid="1CH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34" />Ñooñu ñoo doon kilifay làngi Leween ñi, ni ñu tënke seen cosaan ci limeef yi. Ña nga dëkkoon Yerusalem.<verse eid="1CH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Limeefu bokki Sawul a ngii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35" />Yewel baayu Gabawon, Gabawon la dëkkoon. Maaka la soxnaam tudd. <verse eid="1CH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36" />Taawam bu góor moo doon Abdon, góor ña ca topp di Cur ak Kis ak Baal ak Ner ak Nadab <verse eid="1CH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37" />ak Gedor ak Axyo ak Sàkkaryaa ak Miglot. <verse eid="1CH 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38" />Miglot moomu mooy baayu Simeyam. Ñooñu itam ña nga dëkkoon Yerusalem ñook seeni bokk. <verse eid="1CH 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39" />Ner mooy baayu Kis, Kis di baayu Sawul, Sawul di baayu Yonatan ak Malkisuwa ak Abinadab ak Esbaal. <verse eid="1CH 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40" />Doomu Yonatan ju góor moo di Meribaal, Meribaal di baayu Mise. <verse eid="1CH 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41" />Doomi Mise yu góor ñoo di Piton ak Meleg ak Tareya. <verse eid="1CH 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42" />Axas mooy baayu Yara, Yara di baayu Alemet ak Asmawet ak Simri, Simri di baayu Mocca. <verse eid="1CH 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43" />Mocca mooy baayu Bineya, Bineya di baayu Refaya, Refaya di baayu Elasa, Elasa di baayu Accel. <verse eid="1CH 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44" />Accel amoon na juróom benni doom yu góor, ñuy Asrikam ak Bokkru ak Ismayel ak Seyarya ak Abdiyas ak Xanan. Ñooñu Accel moo leen jur.<verse eid="1CH 9:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10" />
  <para style="ms">Lu jëm ci Daawuda, buuru Israayil</para>
  <para style="mr">(Saar 10—29)</para>
  <para style="s1">Lu jëm ci deewug Sawul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1" />Am na bés waa Filisti song <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char>. Bànni Israayil won waa Filisti gannaaw, daw, ñu bare daanu dee ca tundu Gilbowa. <verse eid="1CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2" />Ci biir loolu waa Filisti ne dann Sawul aki doomam yu góor, rey ca Yonatan ak Abinadab ak Malkisuwa, doomam yu góor yooyu. <verse eid="1CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3" />Xare ba nag gëna mettee fa Sawul féete, fittkat ya jekku ko, mu tiit lool.<verse eid="1CH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4" />Ci kaw loolu Sawul ne gàddukatu gànnaayam: «Boccil sa saamar, jam ma ba mu fëll; lu ko moy paaxe yii dikk, toroxalsi ma.» Waaye gàddukatu gànnaayam nanguwul ndax tiitaange ju réy. Sawul jël saamaru boppam, daldi daaneel boppam ca kaw ñawka ga. <verse eid="1CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5" />Gàddukatu gànnaay ba gis ne Sawul dee na, moom it mu daaneel boppam ca kaw saamaram, daldi dee. <verse eid="1CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6" />Noonu la Sawul deewee. Mook ñetti doomam yu góor ak waa këram yépp ñoo bokk dee.<verse eid="1CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7" />Mboolem bànni Israayil ga ca xur wa nag gis ne mbooloo ma dawe, Sawul aki doomam yu góor dee, ñu génn gental seeni dëkk daw, waa Filisti dikk wuutu leen ca.<verse eid="1CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8" />Ca ëllëg sa, ba waa Filisti dikkee di futtisi néew ya, ca kaw tundu Gilbowa lañu fekk Sawul aki doomam yu góor, ñu tëdd. <verse eid="1CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9" />Ba loolu amee ñu futti Sawul, ba noppi dog boppam booleeki gànnaayam, daldi yeble ca réewum Filisti ba mu daj, ngir yégle seen ndam la ca seeni tuur ak ca askan wa. <verse eid="1CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10" />Gannaaw gi, ñu denc gànnaayi Sawul ca seen genn kër tuur, boppu Sawul ñu wékk ko ca seen kër tuur mu ñuy wax Dagon.<verse eid="1CH 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11" />Ba waa Yabes Galàdd gépp déggee mboolem la waa Filisti def Sawul, <verse eid="1CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12" />jàmbaar ñépp a dem jël néewub Sawul ak néewi doomam yu góor, indi Yabes. Ñu suul leen ca ron garab gu mag ga ca Yabes, ba noppi ñu woor juróom ñaari fan.<verse eid="1CH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13" />Sawul nag deewam ga, la mu fecci Aji Sax ji worma, te sàmmul kàddug Aji Sax ji, moo ko waral. Seetlu na sax ci kuy gisaane rawaani ñu dee, <verse eid="1CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14" />baña laajsi Aji Sax ji. Moo tax mu rey ko, tas nguuram, teg ko ci loxol Daawuda doomu Yese.<verse eid="1CH 10:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Fal nañu Daawuda buur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1" />Ba loolu wéyee Israayil gépp daje Ebron ca Daawuda ne ko: «Noo ngii di say bokk lenqe. <verse eid="1CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2" />Te it démb ak bërki-démb, ba Sawul dee buur sax, yaa doon jiite Israayil ci xare, sa Yàlla Aji Sax ji ne la: “Yaay sàmm Israayil sama ñoñ te yaa leen di yilif.”»<verse eid="1CH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3" />Noonu la magi Israayil ñépp dikke ca Buur Daawuda ca Ebron, mu fasook ñoom <char style="w" lemma="kóllëre g-:">kóllëre</char> foofa ca Ebron, fa kanam Aji Sax ji. Ba mu ko defee ñu sotti Daawuda diwu pal ga, muy buurub Israayil, muy la Aji Sax ji waxoon, Samiyel jottali ko.<verse eid="1CH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawuda nangu na Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4" />Ci biir loolu Daawuda ànd ak Israayil gépp songi Yerusalem ga ñu doon woowe Yebus itam ndax la fa Yebuseeni diiwaan ba dëkke woon. <verse eid="1CH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5" />Yebuseen ña ne Daawuda: «Doo fi dugg de!» Terewul Daawuda nangu tatab <char style="w" lemma="Siyoŋ:">Siyoŋ</char> ga ñu mujj woowe Kër Daawuda.<verse eid="1CH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6" />Ci biir loolu Daawuda waxoon na ne: «Ku ci njëkka rey ab Yebuseen dinaa ko fal mu jiitu ci kilifa yi.» Yowab ma yaayam tuddoon Ceruya nag njëkka song, ba tax mu doon kilifag gàngooru xare ga.<verse eid="1CH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7" />Gannaaw loolu Daawuda dëkk ca biir tata ja; loolu waral ñu di ko woowe Kër Daawuda. <verse eid="1CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8" />Ci kaw loolu Daawuda tabax ay kër yu bees fa ko wër fépp, dale ko ca sëkkub Milo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Milo, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">xur la wu doxoon diggante kër Yàlla ga ak gox ba ñu naan Kër Daawuda. Suleymaan sëkklu ko.</char></note>, Yowab moom defaraat la des ca dëkk ba. <verse eid="1CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9" />Daawuda nag di gëna am doole, te Aji Sax ji Boroom gàngoori xare yi ànd ak moom.<verse eid="1CH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jàmbaari xarey Daawudaa ngi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10" />Ñii ñooy kilifay xare yu Daawuda yi àndoon ak Israayil gépp, ngir jàppale ko bu baax ci nguuram, fal Daawuda buur, muy li Aji Sax ji santaane woon ci ñoñam. <verse eid="1CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11" />Limeefu jàmbaari xare yu Daawudaa ngii:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 11:11">Isbaal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Isbaal </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ak Yosebasebet ak Yasobam, kenn ki la.</char></note>, dib Agmoneen, moo jiite mbëri xare ya. Moo xàcc xeejam, songandoo ñetti téeméeri (300) góor, rey leen.<verse eid="1CH 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12" />Ka ca topp di Elasar doomu Dodo mu Axowa ma bokkoon ca ñetti jàmbaari xare ya. <verse eid="1CH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13" />Moom moo àndoon ak Daawuda ca Pas Damim ba fa Filisteen ña dajee nara xare. Amoon na fa toolub lors bu meññ, ba fees dell. <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">Bànni Israayil</char> danoo njëkkoona dawe Filisteen ñi gannaaw. <verse eid="1CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14" />Waaye Elasar aki nitam taxaw ca digg tool ba, aar tool ba, duma Filisteen ña. Noonu la ci Aji Sax ji maye Israayil ndam lu réy.<verse eid="1CH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15" />Mu am bés ñett ña bokk ca mbëri xare ya fekki Daawuda ca doj wa feggook xunt ma ca Adulam. Mbooloom Filisteen ñaa nga dal ca xuru Refayeen ña. <verse eid="1CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16" />Daawudaa nga ca biir rawtoom. Mu am kuréelu xareb Filisteen gu tollu Betleyem. <verse eid="1CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17" />Ci biir loolu Daawuda dem ba manatula muñ, mu ne: «Éy waay ku ma wutali woon ndox mu ma naan ca mbalkam Betleyem ma ca buntu dëkk ba!» <verse eid="1CH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18" />Noonu ñett ña bëtt dalub Filisteen ña, duyi ndox ca teenu Betleyem ba ca wetu buntu dëkk ba, dikk yót Daawuda. Daawuda nag néegu koo naan; da koo tuur, te Aji Sax ji tax. <verse eid="1CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19" />Mu ne: «Mukk Yàlla tere may naan miim ndox. Xanaa duma naan deretu nit ñii moos ndax seen bakkan xajoon na ci, seen bakkan lañu jaay ba indil ma ndox mi.» Daawuda naanul ndox ma. Jooju jëf la ñetti jàmbaari xare ya def.<verse eid="1CH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20" />Abisay mbokkum Yowab bokkoon na ca mbëri xare ya. Moom moo yékkati xeejam, song ñetti téeméeri góor, rey leen. Mu doxe fa siiw ci ñetti mbëri xare ñooña. <verse eid="1CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21" />Abisay bokk na ca ña gënoona siiw ca kuréel gu tudd Ñett ña; mujj na sax di seen njiit, waaye raw na ba bokkuloon ca Ñett ña.<verse eid="1CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22" />Benaya nag, Yoyadaay baayam, xarekat bu mag la woon, dëkkoon Kabcel. Def na jaloore yu réy! Moo rey ñaari doomi Aryel, Mowabeen ba. Moo wàccoon ci kàmb, bésu tawu yuur, rey fa gaynde. <verse eid="1CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23" />Moom it moo rey waa Misra ba amoon taxawaayu ñaari meetar ak genn-wàll. Xeej ba ca loxol waa Misra baa nga tollu ni këccub ràbb. Moom mu songe ko aw yet, daldi bif xeeju waa Misra ba, nangoo ko cay loxoom, reye ko ko. <verse eid="1CH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24" />Jooju jëf la Benaya doomu Yoyada def. Moom it siiwoon na na ci ñetti mbëri xare ya. <verse eid="1CH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25" />Ñu gënoon koo naw ca kuréel gu tudd Fanweeri jàmbaar ya, waaye raw na ba bokkuloon ca Ñett ña. Daawuda nag def ko njiitu dag ya ko dar.<verse eid="1CH 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26" />Yeneen ñeyi xare yi: Asayel ca la, mbokkum Yowab, ak Elxanan doomu Dodo ma dëkk Betleyem, <verse eid="1CH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27" />ak Samot ma dëkk Aror, ak Elecc mu Palon, <verse eid="1CH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28" />ak Ira, Ikes di baayam, dëkk Tekowa, ak Abiyeser ma dëkk Anatot, <verse eid="1CH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29" />ak Sibekay ma dëkk Usa, ak Ilay ma dëkk Axowa, <verse eid="1CH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30" />ak Maaray ma dëkk Netofa, ak Eledd ma Baana di baayam, dëkk Netofa, <verse eid="1CH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31" />ak Itay ma Ribayi di baayam, dëkk Gibeya gu Beñamineen ñi, ak Benaya mu Piraton.<verse eid="1CH 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32" />Uray ma ca walum Gaas ca la, ak Abyel ma dëkk Araba, <verse eid="1CH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33" />ak Asmawet ma dëkk Baxurim, ak Elyaba mu Saalbon, <verse eid="1CH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34" />ak doomi Asem ma dëkk Gison, ak Yonatan doomu Sage mu Arar, <verse eid="1CH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35" />ak Axiyam doomu Sakar, mu Arar, ak Elifal doomu Ur, <verse eid="1CH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36" />ak Efer ma dëkk Mekera ak Axya mu Palon, <verse eid="1CH 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37" />ak Esro ma dëkk Karmel, ak Naaray doomu Esbay, <verse eid="1CH 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38" />ak Yowel mbokkum Natan, ak Mibar doomu Agari.<verse eid="1CH 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39" />Celeg Amoneen ba bokk na ca, ak Naxaray ma dëkk Beerot te daan gàddu gànnaayi Yowab ma Ceruya di yaayam, <verse eid="1CH 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40" />ak Ira ma dëkk Kër Yeter ak Gareb ma dëkk Kër Yeter itam.<verse eid="1CH 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41" />Uri Etteen ba ca la, ak Sabàdd doomu Axlay, <verse eid="1CH 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42" />ak Adina doomu Sisa, di kilifa ca giirug Ruben, ànd ak fanweeri dag, <verse eid="1CH 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43" />ak Xanan doomu Maaka ak Yosafat mu waa Mitin.<verse eid="1CH 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44" />Usya it ca la, di waa Astarot, ak Sama ak Yewel doomu Otam, mu Arower, <verse eid="1CH 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45" />ak Yediyel doomu Simri, ak Yoxa, mbokkam ma dëkk Ticc, <verse eid="1CH 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46" />ak Elyel ma dëkk Maxawa, ak Yeribay ak Yosawya doomu Elnaam, ak Itma ma dëkk réewum Mowab, <verse eid="1CH 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47" />ak Elyel ak Obedd ak Yaasyel ma dëkk Coba.<verse eid="1CH 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Xarekat ya jàppalesi nañu Daawuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1" />Gannaaw loolu ña fekki woon Daawuda ca Ciglaag, ba muy daw Sawul doomu Kis, bokkoon nañu ci jàmbaar ñi ko daan jàppale ci xare. <verse eid="1CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2" />Dañu daan gànnaayoo ay fitt, mane ndijoor ak càmmoñ ci sànni xeer ak fitt. Ña ca bokkoon ca giirug Beñamin, di giirug Sawul ñii la woon:<verse eid="1CH 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3" />Axyeser moo doon seen njiit, mbokkam Yowas doomu Semaa, ma dëkk Gibeya ca la, ak Yesiyel ak Pelet doomu Asmawet ak Beraka ak Yewu ma dëkk Anatot, <verse eid="1CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4" />ak Ismaya ma dëkk Gabawon di jàmbaar ju bokk ca Fanweer ña, <verse eid="1CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5" />ak Yeremi ak Yaxasyel ak Yoxanan ak Yosabàdd ma dëkk Gedera, <verse eid="1CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6" />ak Elusay ak Yerimot ak Beyalya ak Semerya ak Sefatiya mu Aruf.<verse eid="1CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7" />Elkana it ca la ak Isiya ak Asareel ak Yoweser ak Yasobam, ñooñu askanoo ci Kore, <verse eid="1CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8" />ak itam Yowela ak Sebaja doomu Yeroxam, ma dëkk Gedor.<verse eid="1CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9" />Mu am nag ñu bokk ca giiru Gàdd dëddu Sawul fekki Daawuda ca rawtoom ba ca màndiŋ ma. Ay ñeyi xare lañu woon ñu mana xeex, mane pakk ak xeej, diy gaynde te gaaw ba mel niy kéwél ca tund ya. <verse eid="1CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10" />Eser moo doon seen njiit, Abdiyas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.10 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abdiyas </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mii bokkul ak Yonent Yàlla Abdiyas.</char></note> topp ca di ñaareel, Elyab di ñetteel, <verse eid="1CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11" />Misamana di ñeenteel; Yeremi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yeremi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mii bokkul ak Yonent Yàlla Yeremi.</char></note> di juróomeel, <verse eid="1CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12" />Atay di juróom benneel, Elyel di juróom ñaareel; <verse eid="1CH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13" />Yoxanan di juróom ñetteel, Elsabat di juróom ñeenteel, <verse eid="1CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14" />Yeremi di fukkeel, Magbanay di fukkeel ak benn. <verse eid="1CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15" />Ñooñu bokk ci giiru Gàdd ay njiiti xare lañu woon ñoom ñépp. Ki gënoona tuut ci ñoom manoon naa xeex ak téeméeri góor; ki gëna mag xeex ak junniy góor.<verse eid="1CH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16" />Ñooñu ñooy ña jàlloon dexu Yurdan ca weer wa njëkk ca at ma, fekk mu fees ba ca tàkk ga, daldi dàq mboolem waa xur ya, penkook sowu.<verse eid="1CH 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17" />Ci kaw loolu ñu bokk ci giirug Beñamin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.17 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Beñamin: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sawul mi doon wuta bóom Daawuda, ci giirug Beñamin la bokkoon.</char></note> ak Yuda ànd fekki Daawuda ca rawtoom. <verse eid="1CH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18" />Daawuda génn gatandu leen, ne leen: «Su fekkee ne jàmm ak dimbali ma moo leen indi fi man, dalal naa leen ci xol bu sedd. Waaye su ngeen ma naree lor, jébbal ma samay noon te defuma dara de, Yàlla na ko sunuy Yàllay maam seede te àtte.»<verse eid="1CH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19" />Ba loolu amee leerug Yàlla dikkal Amasay ka jiite Fanweeri jàmbaar ya. Mu ne: «Yaa nu moom, yaw Daawuda, nu far ak yaw, doomu Yese. Jàmm, jàmm rekk a la ñeel, te jàmm ay ñeel ñi lay wallu, ndax sa Yàlla moo lay wallu.» Daawuda nag dalal leen, def leen ay njiit ci gàngooram.<verse eid="1CH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20" />Ci kaw loolu ñu bokk ci giirug Manase fàq, far ak Daawuda ca xare ba mu àndeek waa Filisti, ñu dali ci kaw Sawul. Daawudaaki nitam sax mujjuñoo sotle waa Filisti ndax njiiti waa Filisti dañoo diisoo, ba noppi daldi dàq Daawuda. Booba dañu ne: «Bu Daawuda fàqee farijeek sangam Sawul, sunu bakkan lañu koy feye.»<verse eid="1CH 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21" />Ba Daawuda di dellu Ciglaag nag la ko waa giirug Manase fekksi. Muy Atnax ak Yosabàdd ak Yediyel ak Mikayel ak Yosabàdd ak Eliyu ak Ciletay, ñépp di njiiti kuréeli junni ci giirug Manase. <verse eid="1CH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22" />Ñooñu ndimbal lañu woon ci Daawudaak gàngooram ndax ñeyi xare lañu woon ñoom ñépp te ay njiit lañu woon ca gàngooru xare ga. <verse eid="1CH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23" />Ci biir loolu bés bu Yàlla sàkk, ay nit di fekksi Daawuda ngir jàppale ko, ba mu am mbooloo mu réy te am doole.<verse eid="1CH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24" />Limu nit ñi tollu ci xaree ngii, di ña fekki woon Daawuda ca Ebron ngir jële nguur ga ca Sawul, jox ko ko, muy la Aji Sax ji waxoon.<verse eid="1CH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25" />Waa Yuda juróom benni junneek juróom ñetti téeméer (6 800) lañu, gànnaayoo ay xeej aki pakk.<verse eid="1CH 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26" />Waa giirug Simeyon juróom ñaari junneek téeméeri (7 100) ñeyi xare lañu, tollu ci xare.<verse eid="1CH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ña ñeenti junneek juróom benni téeméer (4 600) lañu. <verse eid="1CH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28" />Ñu ànd ak Yoyada may kilifa ci askanu Aaróona te jiite ñetti junniy nit ak juróom ñaari téeméer (3 700). <verse eid="1CH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29" />Cadog bokkoon na ca, xale bu góor la woon, di ñeyi xare, ànd ak ñaar fukki kilifaak ñaar ca waa kër maamam.<verse eid="1CH 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30" />Waa giirug Beñamin di giirug Sawul ci boppam, ñetti junni (3 000) lañu, ña ca ëpp séddoo kër Sawul ba jant yooyu.<verse eid="1CH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31" />Waa giirug Efrayim ñaar fukki junneek juróom ñetti téeméer (20 800) lañu woon, di ñeyi xare te diy boroomi tur ca seen waa kër maam.<verse eid="1CH 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32" />Waa genn-wàllu giirug Manase ga ca sowu fukki junneek juróom ñett (18 000) lañu woon, di ñu ñu tudd seen tur ñu wara fali Daawuda buur.<verse eid="1CH 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33" />Waa giirug Isaakar ñaari téeméeri kilifa lañu woon ñu ànd ak mboolem seen bokk yi ñu jiite. Ay nit lañu woon ñu mana ràññee diggante ba Israayil mana tollu ak na ñu ca wara jëfe.<verse eid="1CH 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34" />Waa giirug Sabulon juróom fukki junni lañu (50 000), tàggatu ngir xare, gànnaayu ba jekk ci xare, ànd ceek pastéefu xol bu mat sëkk.<verse eid="1CH 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35" />Waa giirug Neftali junniy (1 000) njiiti xare lañu ak fanweeri junniy xarekat ak juróom ñaar (37 000) yu gànnaayoo ay xeej aki pakk.<verse eid="1CH 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36" />Waa giirug Dan ñaar fukki junneek juróom ñett ak juróom benni téeméer (28 600) lañu, di ñu jekk ci xare.<verse eid="1CH 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37" />Waa giirug Aser ñeent fukki junniy (40 000) nit lañu ñu tàggatu ngir xare.<verse eid="1CH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38" />Ña bàyyikoo ca waa giir ya dëkke ca penkub dexu Yurdan, di yoy Ruben ak Gàdd ak geneen wàllu giirug Manase ga téeméeri junneek ñaar fukk (120 000) lañu, yore lépp luy gànnaay.<verse eid="1CH 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39" />Xarekat yooyu yépp a jekk ci xare, ànd ak pastéef gu mat sëkk ba Ebron, ngir fal Daawuda buur, mu jiite Israayil gépp. <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">Bànni Israayil</char> ga ca des gépp mànkoo di benn, topp ñoom it, ngir fal Daawuda buur. <verse eid="1CH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40" />Ñu bokk fa toog ak Daawuda ñetti fan, di lekk aka naan ca la leen seeni bokk waajalaloon. <verse eid="1CH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 12:41" />Seen dëkkandooy gox yooyu def ca seen loxo, ba ca diiwaanu Isaakar ak Sabulon ak Neftali, daldi sëf ay mbaam aki giléem aki berkelle aki nag, indil leen lu ne gàññ: sunguf ak mburu yu ndaw ak figg ak reseñ ju wow ak biiñ akug diw ba ciy nag aki gàtt, ndaxte xewu mbégte la woon ca Israayil.<verse eid="1CH 12:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda dogu naa yóbbu gaalu Yàlla ga Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1" />Ci kaw loolu Daawuda diisook njiiti kuréeli junniy xarekat ya ak njiiti kuréelu téeméer ya ak kilifa yépp. <verse eid="1CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2" />Mbooloom Israayil mépp la wax, ne leen: «Pexe mii ndegam rafetlu ngeen ko te sunu Yàlla Aji Sax ji ànd na ci, nanu yónnee fu nekk ay ndaw yu dem ba ca sunu bokk ya des ci mboolem diiwaani Israayil ak ca <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yaak <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ña ca seeni dëkk ak seeni gox. Su ko defee ñu fekksi nu fii. <verse eid="1CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3" />Bu loolu wéyee nu delloosi sunu <char style="w" lemma="gaalu kóllëre g-:">gaalu Yàlla</char> ga fii ci nun, ndax toppatoowuñu ko woon ca jamonoy Sawul.»<verse eid="1CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4" />Mbooloo ma mépp ànd ca, ndax mébét mu ñu rafetlu la woon, ñoom ñépp. <verse eid="1CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5" />Ba mu ko defee Daawuda woolu Israayil gépp, la ko dale ca dexu Sixor ci Misra ca bëj-saalum, ba Buntu Amat ca bëj-gànnaar, ngir ñu daje, ba jëleji gaalu Yàlla ga Kiryaat Yarim. <verse eid="1CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6" />Ba loolu amee Daawuda ànd ak Israayil gépp dem Baala, ñu di ko wax Kiryaat Yarim itam, ca diiwaanu Yuda, ngir jëleji fa gaalu Yàlla ga ñuy woowe itam gaalu Aji Sax ji Yàlla, kiy toog ci jal bi, diggante malaakay <char style="w" lemma="serub y-:">serub</char> ya.<verse eid="1CH 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7" />Ñu yeb nag gaalu Yàlla ga ci watiir wu bees, jële ko kër Abinadab; Usa ak Axyo jiite watiir wa. <verse eid="1CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8" />Daawudaak waa Israayil gépp a ngay bànneexook doole fa kanam Aji Sax ji; woy ya jib ànd ak xeeti xalam yaak tabala yaak keseŋ-keseŋ yaak liit ya.<verse eid="1CH 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9" />Naka lañu dem ba tollu ca dàggay Kidon, nag ya tërëf, Usa tàllal loxoom, jàpp ca gaalu Yàlla ga. <verse eid="1CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10" />Sànjum Aji Sax ji nag tàkk ci kaw Usa, faat ko ndax la mu teg loxoom ca gaal ga. Foofa la dee, fa kanam Yàlla. <verse eid="1CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11" />Ba loolu amee Daawuda mer ca mbugal mu metti ma Aji Sax ji fàdde Usa. Moo tax mu tudde béreb booba Peres Usa (muy firi Pàddum Usa), tur wa sax ba tey jii.<verse eid="1CH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12" />Daawuda nag am tiitaange lool bésub keroog ca Yàlla. Ma nga naan ca xelam: «Ndax man naa yóbbu gaalu Yàlla gi sama kër yee?» <verse eid="1CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13" />Loolu nag tax Daawuda yóbbuwul gaal ga fa moom ca gox ba ñu naan Kër Daawuda. Dafa waññi gaal gi, yóbbu ko kër Obedd Edom ma cosaanoo Gaat. <verse eid="1CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14" />Gaalu Yàlla ga nekk na kër Obedd Edom, toog ca biir këram diiru ñetti weer. Aji Sax ji barkeel kër Obedd Edom ak mboolem lu mu moom.<verse eid="1CH 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda gën naa siiw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1" />Ci biir loolu Iram buurub Tir yebal ay ndaw ca Daawuda, ñu yóbbul ko ay banti seedar, ak tabaxkati miir ak liggéeykati bant, ngir ñu tabaxal Daawuda kër. <verse eid="1CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2" />Daawuda nag xam ne Aji Sax jee ko fal buurub Israayil te moo kaweel nguuram lool ngir Israayil ñoñam.<verse eid="1CH 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3" />Gannaaw gi, Daawuda denc na yeneeni soxna ca Yerusalem. Mu am ca yeneen doom yu góor ak yu jigéen. <verse eid="1CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4" />Doom yu góor yi juddoo Yerusalem ñoo di Samwa ak Sobab ak Natan ak Suleymaan, <verse eid="1CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5" />ak Ibaar ak Elisuwa ak Elpelet, <verse eid="1CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6" />ak Noga ak Nefeg ak Yafya, <verse eid="1CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7" />ak Elisama ak Beelyada ak Elifelet.<verse eid="1CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8" />Ba waa Filisti déggee ne fal nañu Daawuda buurub Israayil, ñoom ñépp a jóg, di ko wër. Daawuda nag dégg ko daldi leen dogaleji. <verse eid="1CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9" />Waa Filisti dikk, songandoo xuru Refayeen ña. <verse eid="1CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10" />Daawuda laaj Yàlla ne ko: «Ndax ma songi waa Filisti? Dinga leen teg ci sama loxo?» Aji Sax ji ne ko: «Demal, ma teg leen ci sa loxo.» <verse eid="1CH 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11" />Ba mu ko defee Daawuda ak gàngooram dem ba Baal Peracim, Daawuda duma leen foofa. Daawuda nag ne: «Aji Sax jee jaare ci man, Buur, xàll aw yoon, ne jàyy ni walum ndox ca kaw noon ya.» Moo tax ñu woowe béreb boobu Baal Peracim (muy firi Boroom bi xàll naw yoon). <verse eid="1CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12" />Filisteen ña nag waccoon fa seeni tuur, Daawuda santaane ñu boole ko lakk.<verse eid="1CH 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13" />Ba loolu wéyee Filisteen ña dikk songaat xur wa. <verse eid="1CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14" />Daawuda dellu laaj Yàlla. Mu ne ko: «Bul topp seen gannaaw, wër leen ndombo, dal ca seen kaw fa janook garab ya. <verse eid="1CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15" />Booy dégg tànk yuy jaab ca kaw njobbaxtali sànd ya rekk, songal ndax booba Yàllaa la jiitu, di dumaji waa dalub Filisti.» <verse eid="1CH 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16" />Daawuda nag def la ko Yàlla sant, ba ñu duma gàngooru Filisteen ña, la ko dale Gabawon ba Geser.<verse eid="1CH 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17" />Ba loolu amee turu Daawuda siiw lool ca réewoo réew, Aji Sax ji def xeetoo xeet ragal ko.<verse eid="1CH 14:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda jëli na gaalu Aji Sax ji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1" />Daawuda tabaxlu na ay kër ci biir gox ba ñu naan Kër Daawuda. Gannaaw loolu sàkkal na <char style="w" lemma="gaalu kóllëre g-:">gaalu Yàlla</char> ga béreb, sampal ko ab xayma. <verse eid="1CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2" />Ba loolu amee Daawuda ne: «Bu kenn gàddu gaalu Yàlla gi te bokkul ci <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ñi, ngir ñoom la Aji Sax ji tànn ñuy gàddu gaalam ak di liggéeyal Aji Sax ji ba fàww.»<verse eid="1CH 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3" />Ci kaw loolu Daawuda woolu Israayil gépp, ñu daje ca Yerusalem ngir yóbbu gaalu Aji Sax ji ca bérebam ba mu ko sàkkal. <verse eid="1CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4" />Daawuda woo itam askanu Aaróona ak Leween ñi. <verse eid="1CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5" />Ñi jóge ci askanu Keyat: Uryel la, di kilifa, ànd ak téeméeri bokkam ak ñaar fukk.<verse eid="1CH 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6" />Ñi jóge ci askanu Merari: Asaya la, di kilifa, ànd ak ñaari téeméeri bokkam ak ñaar fukk.<verse eid="1CH 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7" />Ñi jóge ci askanu Gersom: Yowel la di kilifa, ànd ak téeméeri bokkam ak fanweer.<verse eid="1CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8" />Ñi jóge ci askanu Elicafan: Semaya la, di kilifa, ànd ak ñaari téeméeri bokkam.<verse eid="1CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9" />Ñi jóge ci askanu Ebron: Elyel la, di kilifa, ànd ak juróom ñett fukki bokkam.<verse eid="1CH 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10" />Ñi jóge ci askanu Usyel: Aminadab la, di kilifa, ànd ak téeméeri bokkam ak fukk ak ñaar.<verse eid="1CH 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11" />Ba loolu amee Daawuda woolu Cadog ak Abyatar, <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> ya ak Leween ña, di Uryel ak Asaya ak Yowel ak Semaya ak Elyel ak Aminadab. <verse eid="1CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12" />Mu ne leen: «Yeen ñiy kilifay kër Leween ñi, sanguleen-set yeen ak seen bokki Leween yi, ba noppi ngeen jëli gaalu Aji Sax jiy Yàllay Israayil, yóbbu ko fa ma ko waajalal, <verse eid="1CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13" />ndax li ngeen teewuloon bu njëkk ba moo tax sunu Yàlla Aji Sax ji dal ci sunu kaw ngir wormaalunu ko ni ko yoon wi laaje.»<verse eid="1CH 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14" />Ba mu ko defee sarxalkat yaak Leween ña sangu-set ngir yóbbu gaalu Aji Sax jiy Yàllay Israayil. <verse eid="1CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15" />Leween ña daldi gàddoo gaalu Yàlla ga njàppu ya, teg ko ca seeni mbagg, na ko Musaa santaane woon te mu dëppook kàddug Aji Sax ji.<verse eid="1CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16" />Daawuda daldi wax kilifay Leween ña ñu taxawal seen bokki woykat, boole kook jumtukaayi xumbéen ya, diy toxorooki xalam aki keseŋ-keseŋ, ñu jibal lépp ba mu xumb lool ci mbégte. <verse eid="1CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17" />Ci biir loolu Leween ña taxawal Eman, ku góor kay doomu Yowel, mu ànd ak ku góor ciy bokkam, di Asaf doomu Berekya, ak seen mbokk mu góor mu ñuy wax Etan doomu Kusaya, bokk ci làngu Merari. <verse eid="1CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18" />Ña nga feggook seen bokki Leween di ay wattukati bunt yu nekk ci seen kilifteef. Muy Sàkkaryaa ak Ben ak Yaasyel ak Semiramot ak Yexyel ak Uni ak Elyab ak Benaya ak Maaseya ak Matica ak Elifelewu ak Migneya ak Obedd Edom ak Yewel. <verse eid="1CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19" />Woykat ya ñuy wax Eman ak Asaf ak Etan nañuy tëgg tamay xànjar. <verse eid="1CH 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20" />Sàkkaryaa nag ànd ak Asyel ak Semiramot ak Yexyel ak Uni ak Elyab ak Maaseya ak Benaya, ñu féetewoo toxoro ya, def ko galan bu dëppook baat ya gëna sew. <verse eid="1CH 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21" />Noonu Matica ak Elifelewu ak Migneya ak Obedd Edom ak Yewel ak Asasya wara ànd jibal xalam ya, jiite woy ya galanu Seminit. <verse eid="1CH 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22" />Kenaña kilifay Leween ña, na jiite woy ya. Looloo doon wàllam ndax ku ko manoon la. <verse eid="1CH 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23" />Berekya ak Elkana ñooy doon wattukati gaal ga, <verse eid="1CH 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24" />ñook wattukati gaal ga ñuy wax Obedd Edom ak Yexya. Ci biir loolu, sarxalkat yii di Sebaña ak Yosafat ak Netaneel ak Amasay ak Sàkkaryaa ak Benaya ak Elyeser, ñoom ñoo féetewoo wal liit ya, jiitu gaalu Yàlla ga.<verse eid="1CH 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25" />Ba mu ko defee Daawuda ànd ak magi Israayil ak njiiti xare ya, ñu jëliji gaalu kóllërey Aji Sax ji kër Obedd Edom, lépp ci biir mbégte. <verse eid="1CH 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26" />Yàlla nag yiir Leween ña gàddu gaalu kóllërey Aji Sax ja, ñu sarxalal ko juróom ñaari yëkk ak juróom ñaari kuuy. <verse eid="1CH 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27" />Daawudaa nga sol mbubbum lẽe, mook Leween ña gàddu gaal ga yépp ak woykat yaak Kenaña ma leen jiite. Daawudaa nga boole ca sol am <char style="w" lemma="xar-sànni m-:">xar-sànnim</char> lẽe. <verse eid="1CH 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28" />Noonu la Israayil gépp ànde yóbbu gaalu kóllërey Aji Sax ji, sarxolle ya jib, ànd ak coowal béjjén ya ñuy wal, ak liit yaak tama ya ak toxoro yaak keseŋ-keseŋ ya ak ay xeeti xalaam.<verse eid="1CH 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29" />Ba gaalu Aji Sax jay duggsi ca biir gox ba ñu naan Kër Daawuda, soxnas Daawuda, Mikal doomu Sawul a nga sëppu ca palanteeram. Mu gis Buur Daawuda di tëb aka fecc. Mu jéppi ko lool.<verse eid="1CH 15:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1" />Gannaaw loolu ñu indi gaalu Yàlla ga, yeb ko ca biir xayma ba ko Daawuda sampal, ba noppi ñu joxe fa kanam Yàlla ay <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxi rendi-dóomal</char> ak <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxi cant ci biir jàmm</char>. <verse eid="1CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2" />Ba Daawuda defee saraxi rendi-dóomal yaak saraxi cant ci biir jàmm, ñaanal na askan wa ci turu Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3" />Daawuda daldi jox kenn ku nekk ci waa Israayil góor ak jigéen menn mburu ak nàkkub tàndarma ak nàkkub reseñ.<verse eid="1CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4" />Ba loolu wéyee Daawuda tànn ñenn ca Leween ña, ñuy liggéey fa kanam gaalu Aji Sax ji, di woy, di sant aka màggal Aji Sax ji Yàllay Israayil. <verse eid="1CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5" />Ñooñu Asaf a leen jiite woon, Sàkkaryaa di seen ñaareelu kilifa, ña ca topp di Yewel ak Semiramot ak Yexyel ak Matica ak Elyab ak Benaya ak Obedd Edom ak Yewel. Ñooñu wara yore ay jumtukaayi xumbéen yu mel ni ay xalam aki kooraa, Asaf yore tabala ji, <verse eid="1CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6" />Benaya ak Yaxasyel, sarxalkat ya, wara dëkke di wal liit ya fa kanam gaalu kóllërey Yàlla ga. <verse eid="1CH 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7" />Bésub keroog la Daawuda njëkka dénk Asaf aki bokkam liggéeyu cant yi, ñeel Aji Sax ji, woy wa jib:<verse eid="1CH 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8" />Santleen Aji Sax ji, tudd turam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:8">xamley jalooreem ci biir xeet yi.<verse eid="1CH 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9" />Woyleen ko, tagg ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:9">yégleleen mboolemi kéemaanam!<verse eid="1CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10" />Damooleen turam wu sell,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:10">yal na kuy wut Aji Sax ji am bànneexu xol.<verse eid="1CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11" />Wutleen Aji Sax ji, sës ci dooleem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:11">Saxooleen koo wër!<verse eid="1CH 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12" />Fàttalikuleen ay jalooreem</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:12">aki kéemaanam aki àtteem.<verse eid="1CH 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13" />Yeen sëti Israayil, jaamam ba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:13">yeen sëti Yanqóoba, yeen ñi mu tànn!<verse eid="1CH 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14" />Kee di sunu Yàlla Aji Sax ji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:14">di àtte suuf sépp.<verse eid="1CH 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15" />Fàttalikuleen <char style="w" lemma="kóllëre g-:">kóllëreem</char> ba fàww,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:15">ak kàddoom ba ci junniy maas.<verse eid="1CH 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16" />Mooy digeem baak Ibraayma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:16">di la mu giñal Isaaxa.<verse eid="1CH 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17" />Moo ko dëggalal Yanqóoba, sàrtal ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:17">fase kook Israayil mooma kóllëre gu sax.<verse eid="1CH 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18" />Moo noon: «Yaw laay jox réewum Kanaan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:18">muy sa cér, nga séddoo.»<verse eid="1CH 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19" />Ba <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> doonee ñu néewa néew,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:19">diy doxandéem ci réew mi,<verse eid="1CH 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20" />di wëreelu ci biir xeetoo xeet,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:20">ak nguuroo nguur,<verse eid="1CH 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21" />mayul kenn mu noot leen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:21">te yaral na leen ay buur,<verse eid="1CH 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22" />ne leen: «Buleen laal ñi ma séddoo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:22">te samay yonent buleen leen lor.»<verse eid="1CH 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23" />Woyleen Aji Sax ji yeen àddina sépp,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:23">siiwalleen xettaleem bésoo bés!<verse eid="1CH 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24" />Siiwalleen màggaayam ci biir xeet yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:24">xamal waasoo waaso ay jalooreem.<verse eid="1CH 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25" />Aji Sax jee màgg, jara sant a sant</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:25">te gëna mata ragal lépp lu ñuy jaamu.<verse eid="1CH 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26" />Mboolem yàlla yi xeet yiy jaamu, yàllantu la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:26">waaye Aji Sax jee sàkk asamaan.<verse eid="1CH 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27" />Màggaay ak daraja, fa moom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:27">doole ak mbégtee nga ca dëkkuwaayam.<verse eid="1CH 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28" />Yeen làngi xeet yi, seedeelleen Aji Sax ji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:28">seedeelleen Aji Sax ji màggaayam ak dooleem.<verse eid="1CH 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29" />Seedeelleen Aji Sax ji màggaayu turam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:29">yékkatil kob sarax, te dikk ci kanamam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:29">Sujjóotalleen Aji Sax ji gànjaroo sellaay.<verse eid="1CH 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30" />Ragalleen ko, bay lox, yeen waa àddina sépp.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:30">Àddinaa ngi sampu ba dëgër moos, maneesu koo rëññeel.<verse eid="1CH 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31" />Asamaanoo, bégal!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:31">Suufoo, bànneexul!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:31">di seede ci biir xeet yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:31">ne Aji Sax jeey Buur!<verse eid="1CH 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32" />Géejoo, riiral yaak mboolem li la fees,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:32">na mbooy mi jaayu, mook lu ci biiram,<verse eid="1CH 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33" />ba garabi àll bi teertoo Aji Sax ji ay sarxolle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:33">ndax moo àttesi àddina.<verse eid="1CH 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34" />Santleen Aji Sax ji, kee baax,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:34">kee saxoo ngoram.<verse eid="1CH 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35" />Àdduleen, ne ko: «Yaw Yàlla mi nuy musal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">wallu nu, génnee nu ci xeet yi, dajale nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">nu sante laak sa tur wu sell,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">di sagoo sa teddaay.<verse eid="1CH 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36" />Santleen Aji Sax ji Yàllay Israayil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:36">cant gu sax dàkk, ba fàww.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">Noonu mbooloo ma mépp ne: «Amiin,» teg ca ne: «Jërëjëfe Aji Sax ji!» <verse eid="1CH 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37" />Ba mu ko defee Daawuda dëddu, bàyyi Asaf aki bokkam ca kanam gaalu Aji Sax ji, ngir ñuy saxoo liggéey fa kanam gaal ga, di fa def la leen war bés bu nekk. <verse eid="1CH 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38" />Ci biir loolu mu tabb ay wattukati bunt; ñuy Obedd Edom, ku góor kay doomu Yedutun, ak juróom benn fukki góor ak juróom ñett (68) ñu mu bokkal, boole ca Osa. <verse eid="1CH 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39" />Ci kaw loolu Daawuda dénk Cadog ak yeneen sarxalkat yi mu bokkal liggéey ba, ca <char style="w" lemma="xaymab ndaje m-:">jaamookaayu Aji Sax</char> ja ca tundu Gabawon. <verse eid="1CH 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40" />Ñuy def bés bu nekk, subaak ngoon, ay saraxi rendi-dóomal ca kaw <char style="w" lemma="sarxalukaay b-:">sarxalukaayu rendi-dóomal</char> ba, ñeel Aji Sax ji. Loolu dëppook mboolem li ñu bind ci téereb yoon wi Aji Sax ji jox Israayil. <verse eid="1CH 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41" />Ba loolu amee ñu ànd ak Eman ak Yedutun ak ñeneen ñi ñu tànn, jagleleen ñu wara sante Aji Sax ji baat yii: «Li ko waral mooy ngoram gi sax dàkk.» <verse eid="1CH 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42" />Eman ak Yedutun ñoo féetewoo woon liit yaak tabala ya ak yeneen jumtukaayi xumbéen yi jëm ci woy Yàlla; doomi Yedutun yu góor nag di taxaw ca bunt ba.<verse eid="1CH 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43" />Ba loolu amee mbooloo mépp dem, ku nekk ñibbi këram. Daawuda it ñibbi këram, ñaanali waa këram.<verse eid="1CH 16:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yàlla dig na Daawuda kër</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1" />Gannaaw gi, Daawuda këram la nekk ab diir. Mu am bés mu wax Yonent Yàlla Natan ne ko: «Xoolal rekk, maa ngi dëkke kërug banti seedar, te <char style="w" lemma="gaalu kóllëre g-:">gaalu kóllërey Aji Sax</char> ji dëkke xaymab ndimo!» <verse eid="1CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2" />Natan ne Daawuda: «Mboolem loo ci namma def rekk, defal, ndax Yàlla yaw la àndal.» <verse eid="1CH 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3" />La ca tegu, guddig keroog, kàddug Yàlla dikkal Natan, ne ko: <verse eid="1CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4" />«Demal wax Daawuda samab jaam, ne ko: “Aji Sax ji dafa wax ne: Du yaw yaa may tabaxal kër gu ma dëkke. <verse eid="1CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5" />Bés ba ma génnee <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> ca Misra ba tey jii, masumaa dëkk ci kër. Naka jekk cib xayma laay jóge, dal cib xayma, toxoo cib dëkkuwaay dal ci beneen. <verse eid="1CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6" />Mboolem fu ma masa ànd ak Israayil gépp, ndax mas naa wax benn baat kenn ci njiiti Israayil yi ma sant ñu sàmm sama ñoñ, ne leen: ‘Lu tere nga tabaxal ma kërug bantu seedar?’ <verse eid="1CH 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7" />Kon nag waxal sama jaam Daawuda, ne ko: Aji Sax ji Boroom gàngoori xare yi dafa wax ne: Maa la jële ca parlu ga nga toppe woon gàtt ya, ngir nga doon kilifag Israayil, sama ñoñ. <verse eid="1CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8" />Maa ànd ak yaw fépp foo dem, maa tenqee fi sa kanam mboolem say noon, te maa lay may tur wu tollu ni turi boroom daraja yi ci àddina. <verse eid="1CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9" />Maay sàkkal Israayil sama ñoñ ab dëkkuwaay, samp leen fa, ñu dëkke ko, te deesu leen fa lëjalati. Ñu bon ñi duñu leen taxa ñàkk yaram na woon, <verse eid="1CH 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10" />ba ma falee ay njiit ci kaw Israayil sama ñoñ. Maay nasaxal sa noon yépp. Te it maa ngi lay yégal ne la, Aji Sax ji moo lay sosal kër. <verse eid="1CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11" />Te boo demee ba say fan mat ba nga fekki say maam, su boobaa maay yékkati kenn ci saw askan mu wuutu la, jóge ci sa geño; te maay taxawal nguuram. <verse eid="1CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12" />Kookoo may tabaxal kër te maay taxawal ab jalam ba fàww. <verse eid="1CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13" />Man baayam laay doon, moom muy sama doom, te sama cofeel duma ko ko xañ mukk, ni ma ko xañe woon ki nga wuutu ci jal bi. <verse eid="1CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14" />Maa koy dëj mu jiite sama waa kër, jiite sama nguur ba fàww te ab jalam day sax ba fàww.”»<verse eid="1CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15" />Noonee Natan jote mboolem kàddu yooyu ak peeñu moomu, na la ko yegge Daawuda.<verse eid="1CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lu jëm ci ñaanu Daawuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16" />Ba loolu amee Buur Daawuda dikk ba fa kanam Aji Sax ji, daldi toog ne ko: «Céy Aji Sax ji Yàlla, ana lu ma tekki, man, ak lu sama waa kër tekki, ba tax nga indi ma ba fii ma àgg? <verse eid="1CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17" />Yàlla sama Boroom, loolu sax doyatu la, xanaa nga dem ba waxaale ci sama askan wi sosoogul, Sang bi. Aji Sax ji Yàlla, geesu nga ma moos, ba mu mel ni damaa bokk ci nit ñi am daraja. <verse eid="1CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18" />Ana lu ma lay waxati man Daawuda sab jaam ci teraanga ji nga ma defal? Yaw de, yaa ma ràññee, man sab jaam. <verse eid="1CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19" />Céy Aji Sax ji, Sang bi, yaa def mboolem jii jëf ju réy ci sa yéeney xol, yaa xamle mboolem mbir yu réy yii. <verse eid="1CH 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20" />Aji Sax ji, kenn du yaw, kenn it du Yàlla ku dul yaw, te mboolem lu nu nopp may, dëggal na loolu. <verse eid="1CH 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21" />Ana askan wu mel ni Israayil sa ñoñ, di wenn askan fi kaw suuf, woo dikk jotal sa bopp yaw, ñoñoo leen. Siiwal nga saw tur moos, ba nga defee ay jaloore aki kéemaan ba dàq ay xeeti xeet ngir sa ñoñ ñi nga goreele fa Misra. <verse eid="1CH 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22" />Def nga Israayil sa ñoñ, ñoñoo leen ba fàww, te yaw Aji Sax ji yaa di seen Yàlla.<verse eid="1CH 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23" />«Kon nag Aji Sax ji, Sang bi, li nga ma dig, man, ak sama waa kër, saxal ko ba fàww, te nga defe ko noonu nga ko waxe. <verse eid="1CH 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24" />Su boobaa saw tur mooy sax, di gëna màgg ba fàww, ñu naan: “Aji Sax ji Boroom gàngoori xare yi, di Yàllay Israayil, yaay Yàlla ji nekkal Israayil.” Sama waa kër nag, man Daawuda, yal nañu sax fi sa kanam, Sang bi.<verse eid="1CH 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25" />«Ndax kat sama Yàlla, yaw déy yaa ma déey, Sang bi, ne kër nga may sosal. Moo tax ma ñeme laa ñaan lii, Sang bi. <verse eid="1CH 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26" />Léegi nag yaw Aji Sax ji, yaa di Yàlla te yaa ma dig yiw wii, Sang bi. <verse eid="1CH 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27" />Kon nag Sang bi, nangula barkeel sama kër, ngir mu sax ba fàww fi sa kanam. Ndax kat yaw Aji Sax ji, yaa ko barkeel, kon nag dina barkeel moos, ba fàww.»<verse eid="1CH 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda daan na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1" />Gannaaw ba loolu wéyee Daawuda duma na Filisteen ña, noot leen, nangoo ci seen loxo dëkk ba ñuy wax Gaat ak dëkk yu ndaw ya ko wër. <verse eid="1CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2" />Mu teg ca duma Mowabeen ña, ñu nangul ko, di ko indil galag.<verse eid="1CH 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3" />Ba loolu wéyee Daawuda duma Adadeser buurub Coba, ca wetu Amat, fekk Adadeser dem fa di lawal nguuram ca tàkkal dexu Efraat. <verse eid="1CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4" />Daawuda nangoo ca moom junniy (1 000) watiir, jàpp juróom ñaari junniy (7 000) gawar ak ñaar fukki junniy (20 000) xarekat yu warul. Daawuda teg ca dog sidditi tànki fas yi ñu takkal watiir yépp, bàyyiwu ca lu moy téeméer.<verse eid="1CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5" />Waa Siri ña dëkke réewum Damaas dikk wallusi Adadeser buurub Coba. Daawuda duma ca ñoom ñaar fukki junneek ñaar (22 000). <verse eid="1CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6" />Ba mu ko defee Daawuda tabb ay jawriñam ca Damaas ca Siri, waa Siri di surgawu Daawuda, di ko indil galag. Aji Sax ji may Daawuda ndam fépp fu mu dem. <verse eid="1CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7" />Ci biir loolu Daawuda nangu pakki wurus ya jawriñi Adadeser takkoon, daldi koy yóbbu Yerusalem. <verse eid="1CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8" />Dëkki Adadeser ya ñuy wax Tibat ak Kun itam xànjar ju takku lool la fa Daawuda nangoo. Ca la Suleymaan defarlu mbalkam xànjar ma ak ay kenu xànjar yaak yeneen ndabi xànjar.<verse eid="1CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9" />Ci kaw loolu Towu buurub Amat dégg ne Daawuda duma na mboolem gàngooru Adadeser buurub Coba. <verse eid="1CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10" />Mu yebal Adoram, doomam ju góor ca Buur Daawuda, di ko yóbbante nuyoob jàmm, ak ndokkale ci jéll bi mu daan Adadeser, ndax Adadeser xare woon naak Towu. Mboolem luy wurus ak xaalis ak xànjar nag Adadeser yóbbante na ko ko. <verse eid="1CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11" />Buur Daawuda nag jagleel ko Aji Sax ji, boole kook xaalis baak wurus wa mu nangoo woon ca mboolem réew yi: Edomeen ñaak Mowabeen ñaak Amoneen ñaak waa Filisteek Amalegeen ña.<verse eid="1CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12" />Abisay, ku góor kay doomu Ceruya jam na fukki junniy Edomeen ak juróom ñett (18 000) ca xuru Xorom wa. <verse eid="1CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13" />Gannaaw gi, tabb na ay jawriñam ca réewum Edom, ba Edomeen ñépp di surgawu Daawuda. Ci kaw loolu Aji Sax ji may Daawuda ndam fépp fu mu xaree.<verse eid="1CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñii ñooy jawriñi Daawuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14" />Buur Daawuda ci kaw Israayil gépp la nguuru woon, muy jëfe dëgg ak yoon ñeel réewam mépp. <verse eid="1CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15" />Yowab, mi Ceruya di ndeyam, moo jiite woon gàngooru xare ga. Yosafat doomu Axiludd yore kàddug buur. <verse eid="1CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16" />Cadog doomu Axitub ak Abimeleg doomu Abyatar ñoo doon <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> ya, Sawsa di bindkat ba. <verse eid="1CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17" />Benaya doomu Yoyada moo jiite woon waa Keret ak waa Pelet. Doomi Daawuda yu góor di kilifay jawriñi buur, feggook moom.<verse eid="1CH 18:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda daan na Amoneen ña</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1" />Jamono nag di dox ba Naxas buurub Amoneen ña dee, doomam ju góor falu wuutu ko. <verse eid="1CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2" />Daawuda ne: «Dinaa yéwéne Anun doomu Naxas, na ma baayam yéwénee woon.» Ci kaw loolu Daawuda yebal ay ndawam ca Anun, di ko jaal baayam. Ba ndawi Daawuda agsee ca réewum Amoneen ña di jaalsi Anun, <verse eid="1CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3" />njiiti Amoneen ña wax ak Anun ne ko: «Defe nga ne moos wormaal sa baay la Daawuda namm, ba yónnee la ay nit ñu la jaal? Foogoo ne seetsi réew mi ak nemmikusi ko, ba song ko moo tax Daawuda yebal ay nitam ci yaw?» <verse eid="1CH 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4" />Anun daldi jàpp niti Daawuda ña, wat leen, duppati seeni mbubb fa tollook toogukaay ba, door leena bàyyi ñu dem. <verse eid="1CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5" />Nit dikk yegge Daawuda seen mbir. Mu yebal ñu leen gatanduji ndax na ñu leen toroxale. Buur ne leen ñu toog Yeriko, ba seeni sikkim sëqaat, ñu doora ñibbisi.<verse eid="1CH 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6" />Gannaaw loolu Amoneen ña xam ne merloo nañu Daawuda. Anun ak Amoneen ña daldi yónnee ñetti téeméeri barigoy xaalis ak ñeent fukk (340) ngir bindeji ko ay watiir aki gawar ca waa Siri ña ca diiwaanu Naarim, ak waa Siri ña ca diiwaani Maaka ak Coba. <verse eid="1CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7" />Ñu bind nag fanweeri junneek ñaar (32 000) ciy watiir aki gawar, bindaale buuru Maaka mooki xarekatam, nu dikk dal ca wetu Medeba. Ci biir loolu ñu jóge ca seeni dëkk daje, àndandoo nara xareji. <verse eid="1CH 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8" />Daawuda dégg ko, yebal Yowab ak mboolem gàngooru jàmbaar ya. <verse eid="1CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9" />Ba mu ko defee Amoneen ña génn làng-dér ca seen buntu dëkk ba. Buur yi leen sotlesee nga taxawe nee ca àll ba, seen wetu bopp.<verse eid="1CH 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10" />Yowab nag gis làngi xare yi ñu wara jànkoonteel, ña ko féete kanam ak ña ca gannaaw. Mu tànne ca gàngooru Israayil ay jàmbaari xare, ñu làng-déral waa Siri. <verse eid="1CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11" />La des ca gàngoor ga nag mu teg leen ca loxol rakkam Abisay, yebal leen ñu jànkoontejeek Amoneen ña. <verse eid="1CH 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12" />Yowab ne Abisay: «Su ma waa Siri ëppee doole, nga wallusi ma; su la Amoneen ñi ëppee doole, ma wallusi la. <verse eid="1CH 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13" />Dëgërluleen nag te nu góor-góorlu xeexal sunu xeet ak sunu dëkki Yàlla yii. Aji Sax ji nag yal na def liy coobareem.» <verse eid="1CH 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14" />Ba loolu amee Yowab ak gàngoor ga ànd ak moom sàqi, song waa Siri xare, ñu daw, won leen gannaaw. <verse eid="1CH 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15" />Amoneen ña gis waa Siri di daw, ñoom it ñu daw, won Abisay rakki Yowab gannaaw, ba dellu ca biir dëkk ba. Yowab nag dellu Yerusalem.<verse eid="1CH 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16" />Ci biir loolu waa Siri gis ne Israayil duma na leen, ñu yónni ay ndaw, jëli waa Siri ña ca wàllaa dexu Efraat, Sofag njiital gàngooru Adadeser jiite leen.<verse eid="1CH 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17" />Naka lañu ko wax Daawuda, mu woo Israayil gépp, ànd ak ñoom, jàll dexu Yurdan wuti leen, daldi làng-dér janook ñoom. Daawuda làng-dér jànkoonteek waa Siri ca seen xare baak moom. <verse eid="1CH 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18" />Waaye waa Siri ñoo daw, won Israayil gannaaw, Daawuda rey ca ñoom juróom ñaari junniy (7 000) gawar yuy dawal watiir ak ñeent fukki junniy (40 000) góor ñu warul. Sofag njiital xare ba it, mu rey ko.<verse eid="1CH 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19" />Ba jawriñi Adadeser gisee ne daanu nañu fa kanam Israayil, dañoo jàmmook Daawuda, nangul ko. Loolu tax waa Siri nangootuñoo sotle Amoneen ña.<verse eid="1CH 19:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20" />
  <para style="s1">Amoneen ña daanu nañu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1" />Gannaaw loolu ca ndoortel at ma ca topp, yemook jamono ja buur ya daan xareji, Yowab daa jiite gàngooru xare gu takku, dem yàqate réewum Amoneen ña, gaw dëkk ba ñuy wax Raba. Fekk na Daawuda des Yerusalem. Yowab nag song Raba, faagaagal ko. <verse eid="1CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2" />Daawuda nangu seen mbaxanam buur ma ñu solal jëmmu tuur ma ñuy wax Milkom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Am na yeneen mbind yu yàgg yu indi ne seen buur lañu daan solal mbaxana mi.</char></note>. Diisaayu mbaxana maa nga tollu ci fanweeri kiloy wurus ak ñeent, aw doj wu gànjare tappe ca. Ñu solal ko Daawuda. Alal ju baree bare la Daawuda nangoo ca dëkk ba. <verse eid="1CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3" />Waa dëkk ba, mu génne leen, teg leen liggéeyu sañul-bañ, féetale leen ay xasukaay ngajjuy weñ aki sémmiñ. Noonu la Daawuda def ak dëkki Amoneen ñépp. Gannaaw loolu Daawuda ànd ak gàngooru xareem gépp, dellu Yerusalem.<verse eid="1CH 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Niti Daawuda daan nañu waa Filisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4" />Ñu dem ba jëmmi jamono, xare jib seen digg ak Filisteen ña ca dëkk ba ñuy wax Geser. Booba la Sibekay ma askanoo ci Usa, rey Sippay, jenn waay ju bokk ca askanu ponkal ya. Ci biir loolu ñu noot leen.<verse eid="1CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5" />Xare amati seen digg ak Filisteen ñi, Elxanan doomu Yaare rey Laxmi mbokkum Golyaat ma dëkk Gaat. Kookoo di waa ja bantub xeejam réyoon, bay saf mbaam mu ñuy ràbbe.<verse eid="1CH 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6" />Xare dellu amati ca Gaat, menn ponkal a nga ca, am juróom benni baaraam ci loxo bu nekk ak juróom benni baaraam tànk bu nekk, lépp di ñaar fukki baaraam ak ñeent. Moom it am ponkalum Rafayeen la woon. <verse eid="1CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7" />Ba mu tëkkoo Israayil, Yonatan ma Simeya magi Daawuda di baayam, moo ko rey.<verse eid="1CH 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8" />Ñooñu ay ponkali Rafayeen lañu woon ca Gaat. Daawudaaki nitam ñoo leen jam, ñu daanu.<verse eid="1CH 20:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda waññ na bànni Israayil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1" />Mu am bés <char style="w" lemma="Seytaane:">Seytaane</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Seytaane </char><char style="ft" closed="false">li muy firi mooy ab noon.</char></note> jógal Israayil, daldi xiir Daawuda ci lim Israayil. <verse eid="1CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2" />Daawuda wax Yowab ak njiiti mbooloo ma, ne leen: «Demleen ngeen waññil ma Israayil, dale ko Beerseba ga ca bëj-saalum, ba Dan ga ca bëj-gànnaar, doora délsi fi indil ma, ma xam seen lim.»<verse eid="1CH 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3" />Yowab ne ko: «Buur, yal na Aji Sax ji ful askan wi téeméeri yoon, waaye sang bi, xanaa du ñoom ñépp say surga lañu? Loo namm ci loolu, ba nara yóbbe Israayil ag tooñ?»<verse eid="1CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4" />Terewul kàddug Buur ëpp doole Yowab. Yowab bàyyikoo fa, wëri Israayil gépp, ba délsiwaat Yerusalem.<verse eid="1CH 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5" />Ba mu ko defee Yowab indil Daawuda limu askan wa, Israayil gépp di junniy junni ak téeméeri junniy (1 100 000) góor ñu tollu ci xare, Yuda am ñeenti téeméeri junniy góor ak juróom ñaar fukki junni (470 000), ñépp tollu ci xare.<verse eid="1CH 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6" />Waaye giiri <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Lewi</char> ak Beñamin, Yowab limaalewu leen, ndax ndigalal buur la da ko soofoon lool. <verse eid="1CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7" />Ndigal loolu nag Yàlla ñaawlu ko, ba tax mu mbugal Israayil.<verse eid="1CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8" />Ba loolu amee Daawuda ne Yàlla: «Bàkkaar naa lool ndax lii ma def. Léegi nag Boroom bi, ngalla jéggal ma samag ñaawtéef ndax jëfi dof ju réy lool laa def.» <verse eid="1CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9" />Aji Sax ji wax Gàdd boroom peeñu bu Daawuda, ne ko: <verse eid="1CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10" />«Demal wax Daawuda ne ko: “Aji Sax ji dafa wax ne: Ñett laa lay jox; yaay tànn lu ma la ciy def.”»<verse eid="1CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11" />Gàdd dem ca Daawuda jottali ko wax ja, ne ko: «Aji Sax ji dafa wax ne: Tànnalal sa bopp. <verse eid="1CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12" />Diggante ñetti ati xiif ak ñetti weer yooy daw say noon ñu di la dab ak saamar, ak ñetti fani saamaru Aji Sax ji, di mbas ci réew mi, <char style="w" lemma="malaakam Aji Sax j-:">malaakam Aji Sax</char> ji di faat <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> wet gu nekk. Léegi tànn ci lenn, ma xam lu may waxi ki ma yónni.» <verse eid="1CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13" />Daawuda ne Gàdd: «Am naa njàqare lool, waaye naa tàbbi ci loxol Aji Sax ji rekk ndax yërmandeem yaa na lool, waaye loxol doom aadama moom, yàlla buma ci daanu.»<verse eid="1CH 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14" />Ba mu ko defee Aji Sax ji wàcce mbas ci kaw Israayil, juróom ñaar fukki junniy (70 000) nit dee ca Israayil. <verse eid="1CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15" />Naka la Yàlla yónni malaaka ca Yerusalem ngir mu faat leen, mu leen di faat nag, Aji Sax ji gis ko, naqarlu njekkar la, daldi wax ak malaakam reykat ma ne ko: «Léegi doy na! Teggil sa loxo.» Booba malaakam Aji Sax jaa nga taxaw ca dàggay Ornan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ornan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mooy Arawna ba tey. Seetal ci </char><char style="bk">2.Samiyel</char> 24.16.</note> Yebuseen ba.<verse eid="1CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16" />Daawuda teen, gis malaakam Aji Sax ji taxaw diggante asamaan ak suuf. Ma nga bocci saamaram, ŋàbb ca loxoom, xàcc, mu tiim Yerusalem. Daawuda ak magi Israayil ànd ne gurub, dëpp seen jë fa suuf. Ña nga sol ay saaku, di ko toroxloo.<verse eid="1CH 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17" />Daawuda nag ne Yàlla: «Xanaa du man maa dogoo lim askan wi? Man miy sàmm bi déy, maa bàkkaar, maa def lu bona bon. Ñii diy xar doŋŋ, topp ci man, lu ñu def? Aji Sax ji sama Yàlla, na sa loxo dal ci sama kaw man kay, maak sama waa kër baay! Mbas mi bumu dal saw askan!» <verse eid="1CH 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18" />Fekk na malaakam Yàlla ne Gàdd mu sant Daawuda, ngir mu dem tabaxal Aji Sax ji <char style="w" lemma="sarxalukaay b-:">sarxalukaay</char> ca dàggay Ornan, Yebuseen ba. <verse eid="1CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19" />Daawuda dem ca, na ko ko Aji Sax ji sante, Gàdd jottali.<verse eid="1CH 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20" />Ba mu ko defee Ornan séen malaaka ma. Ñeenti doomam dem làquji, Ornan di bàcc am pepp. <verse eid="1CH 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21" />Ba Daawuda dikkee ba ci Ornan, Ornan séen Buur, daldi génn dàgga ja, sujjóotal Daawuda, dëpp jëëm ca suuf. <verse eid="1CH 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22" />Daawuda ne ko: «Jox ma sa béreb bii nga def dàgga, ndax ma tabaxal fi Aji Sax ji sarxalukaay, ndax mbas mi dal ci kaw askan wi yem fi. Jox ma ko, ma wecci la ko njëg gu mat sëkk.»<verse eid="1CH 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23" />Ornan ne Daawuda: «Buur, sang bi, jëlal, def ko lu la neex. Nag yaa ngii, def ko <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxu rendi-dóomal</char>, watiir yi, nga def ko matt, bele bi nga def <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxu pepp</char>. Lépp jox naa la ko.»<verse eid="1CH 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24" />Teewul Buur Daawuda ne Ornan: «Déedéet, jënd kay laay def ci njëg gu mat sëkk sax, ndax duma jël sa alal di ko jox Aji Sax ji; te duma jël lu ma dikkewul dara di ko def saraxu rendi-dóomal.»<verse eid="1CH 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25" />Noonu Daawuda fey Ornan ca pàkk ba juróom benni téeméeri siikali wurus. <verse eid="1CH 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26" />Gannaaw loolu Daawuda tabaxal fa Aji Sax ji sarxalukaay, rendi fa ay juri saraxu rendi-dóomal ak ay <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxi cant ci biir jàmm</char>. Mu woo Aji Sax ji wall, Aji Sax ji nangul ko, misaale ko ko sawara wu wàcce asamaan, tàkk ca kaw sarxalukaayu rendi-dóomal ba.<verse eid="1CH 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27" />Ci biir loolu Aji Sax ji wax ak malaaka ma, mu delloo saamaram ca mbar ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28" />Ci jant yooyu, Daawuda gis ne Aji Sax ji nangul na ko ca dàggay Ornan Yebuseen ba, mu di fa faral di ko fa defal ay sarax. <verse eid="1CH 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29" />Ndaxte <char style="w" lemma="xaymab ndaje m-:">jaamookaay</char> ba Musaa yékkati woon ca màndiŋ ma, ak sarxalukaayu rendi-dóomal ba, ña nga woon jant yooyu ca kaw tund wa ca Gabawon.<verse eid="1CH 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30" />Waaye Daawuda manul woona dem foofa sàkku ndimbalu Yàlla ndax ragal saamaru malaakam Aji Sax ji.<verse eid="1CH 21:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda waajal na liggéeyu jaamookaay bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1" />Daawuda nag ne: «Fii la kër Aji Sax ji Yàlla te fii la <char style="w" lemma="sarxalukaay b-:">sarxalukaayu rendi-dóomal</char> bi nekkal Israayil.»<verse eid="1CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2" />Ba mu ko defee Daawuda joxe ndigal ñu woo doxandéem yi ci réewum Israayil, mu tànn ca ñoom ay yattkati doj yuy yatt ay doj yu ñuy tabaxe kër Yàlla ga. <verse eid="1CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3" />Ci kaw loolu mu waajal weñ gu ñuul gu takku ngir ponti bunt ya cay dem ak lafi bunt ya ak weñi wewukaayam ak xànjar ju bare ba maneesu koo waññ. <verse eid="1CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4" />Banti seedar ya it maneesu koo lim ndax waa Sidon ak waa Tir indil nañu Daawuda banti seedar yu baree bare.<verse eid="1CH 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />Daawuda daldi ne: «Sama doom Suleymaan gone la te xamul àddina, te kër gi ñuy tabaxal Aji Sax ji wara màgg lool ba yéeme, yànj te am daraja ba siiw, xeet yépp gis ko. Kon nag dama koy daldi waajal.» Daawuda waajal na lu bare bala moo dee.<verse eid="1CH 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />La ca topp mu woo doomam Suleymaan, sant ko ne ko mu tabaxal Yàllay Israayil kër. <verse eid="1CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7" />Daawuda ne Suleymaan: «Doom, li ma mébétoon ci sama xol mooy tabax kër ngir sama turu Yàlla, Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8" />Waaye kàddug Aji Sax ji dikkal ma, ne ma: “Deret ju bare nga tuur, xare lu bare; kon nag doo tabax kër di ma ko tudde man, ndax deret ju ne gàññ nga tuur ci kaw suuf, may gis. <verse eid="1CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9" />Waaye déglul, dinga am doom ju góor juy doon nitu jàmm te dinaa ko may ay noonam yi ko wër yépp jàmmal ko. Suleymaan (muy firi Boroom jàmm ji) sax lay tudd, te jàmm akug dal lay may Israayil giiru dundam. <verse eid="1CH 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10" />Moom mooy tabax kër, tudde ko samaw tur, mel ni doom ci man, ma mel ni baay ci moom te maay saxal ngànguney nguuram ci Israayil ba fàww.”<verse eid="1CH 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />«Léegi nag doom, yal na Aji Sax ji ànd ak yaw ba nga man koo tabaxal kër, moom sa Yàlla Aji Sax ji, mu dëppook li mu wax ci yaw. <verse eid="1CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12" />Yal na la Aji Sax ji may xel mu rafet ak xam-xam bés bu lay jox kilifteefug Israayil, ndax nga mana sàmm yoonam, moom sa Yàlla Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13" />Soo dee sàmm tey jëfe dogal yeek ndigali yoon yi Aji Sax ji dénk Musaa ngir <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char>, su boobaa dinga baaxle moos. Góor-góorlul nag te am fit dëgër. Bul ragal, bul yoqi.<verse eid="1CH 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14" />«Gisal, sonn naa lu ma man, ngir waajal tabaxu kër Aji Sax ji; wurus, dajale naa ci fanweeri barigo ak ñeent; xaalis, ñetti téeméeri junniy barigo ak ñeent fukk; xànjar beek weñ gu ñuul gi, maneesu koo natt ndax bare. Ay bant aki doj it waajal naa ko, ak loo ci mana dolli.<verse eid="1CH 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15" />«Am nga liggéeykat yu bare. Am na ñuy toj aka yatt ay doj ak liggéeykati bant ak ñu mane lépp luy xeetu liggéey. <verse eid="1CH 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16" />Wurus wi ak xaalis bi ak xànjar bi ak weñ gu ñuul gi, maneesu koo waññ. Ayca boog ci liggéey bi, te yal na Aji Sax ji ànd ak yaw.»<verse eid="1CH 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17" />Gannaaw gi, Daawuda sant mboolem kilifay Israayil ne leen ñu jàppale doomam Suleymaan. <verse eid="1CH 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18" />Mu ne leen: «Xanaa du seen Yàlla Aji Sax jaa ngi ànd ak yeen, may leen jàmm fi leen wër fépp? Ndax kat teg na ci sama loxo waa réew mi, ba réew mi mépp nangul Aji Sax ji, nangul ñoñam. <verse eid="1CH 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19" />Kon nag nangeen yeboo xol ci wut seen Yàlla Aji Sax ji, teg ci seen bakkan. Aycaleen boog ci tabax kër gu sell gu ñeel Yàlla Aji Sax ji, ba mana yeb <char style="w" lemma="gaalu kóllëre g-:">gaalu kóllërey Aji Sax</char> ji ak ndabi Yàlla yu sell yi ci biir kër gi ñu tabax, tudde ko turu Aji Sax ji.»<verse eid="1CH 22:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda tabb na Leween ñi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1" />Ba Daawuda màggatee, làq ay ati at ba doyal, doomam Suleymaan la fal buurub Israayil. <verse eid="1CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2" />Mu teg ca woolu mboolem kilifay Israayil ak <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yaak <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ña. <verse eid="1CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3" />Ba ñu waññee Leween ña dale ko ca ña am fanweeri at jëm kaw, lim ba bépp fanweeri junni ak juróom ñett la (38 000). <verse eid="1CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4" />Daawuda ne: «Ñaar fukki junni ak ñeent (24 000) ca ñoom ñooy sasoo liggéeyu kër Aji Sax ji, juróom benni junni (6 000) diy saytukat aki àttekat. <verse eid="1CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5" />Ñeenti junni (4 000) di ay wattukati bunt, ñeenti junni (4 000) di woyal Aji Sax ji mu ànd ak jumtukaayi xumbéen yi ma defarlu, ñu di ko sante Yàlla.»<verse eid="1CH 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6" />Ci kaw loolu Daawuda séddale Leween ñi ñetti kuréel yu dëppook ñetti làngi doomi Lewi yu góor ya leen meññ, di Gerson ak Keyat ak Merari.<verse eid="1CH 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Askanu Gerson a ngii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7" />Askanu Gerson di Ladan ak Simey. <verse eid="1CH 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8" />Doomi Ladan yu góor ñoo di Yexyel may taaw ak Setam ak Yowel, ñuy ñett.<verse eid="1CH 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9" />Doomi Simey yu góor ñoo di Selomit ak Asyel ak Aran, ñuy ñett ñooñu ñoo doon kilifay kër yi soqikoo ci Ladan.<verse eid="1CH 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10" />Doomi Simey yu góor ñoo di Yaxat ak Sisa ak Yewus ak Berya. <verse eid="1CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11" />Yaxat moo doon taaw, Sisa di ñaareelu doomam, waaye Yewus ak Berya barelewuñu ay doom yu góor, ba tax ñu boole leen genn kër ca lim ba.<verse eid="1CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Askanu Keyat a ngii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12" />Askanu Keyat di Amram ak Iccar ak Ebron ak Usyel. <verse eid="1CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13" />Doomi Amram yu góor ñoo di Aaróona ak Musaa. Aaróona nag ñu jagleel ko Aji Sax ji, mook askanam ba fàww, mu féetewoo liggéeyu <char style="w" lemma="néeg bu sell b-:">néeg bu sella sell</char> bi, di taalal Aji Sax ji saraxu <char style="w" lemma="cuuraay l-:">cuuraay</char>, di ko jaamu tey ñaanal askan wi ci turu Aji Sax ji ba fàww. <verse eid="1CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14" />Góor ñiy doomi Musaa, nitug Yàlla ka, ñoom dañu leena limaale ci giirug <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ñi.<verse eid="1CH 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15" />Doomi Musaa yu góor ñoo di Gersom ak Elyeser. <verse eid="1CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16" />Taawub Gersom bu góor moo di Sebuwel. <verse eid="1CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17" />Elyeser kenn la am ci doom ju góor, muy Rexabya; amul keneen, waaye ñu bare soqeekoo nañu ci Rexabya.<verse eid="1CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18" />Doomi Iccar ju góor moo di Selomit, taawam.<verse eid="1CH 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19" />Doomi Ebron yu góor ñoo di Yerya taawam, ñaareel ba di Amarya, ñetteel ba di Yaxasyel, ñeenteel ba di Yekamam.<verse eid="1CH 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20" />Doomi Usyel yu góor ñoo di Mise, taawam, ñaareel ba di Isiya.<verse eid="1CH 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Askanu Meraree ngii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21" />Doomi Merari yu góor ñoo di Maxli ak Musi. Doomi Maxli yu góor ñoo di Elasar ak Kis.<verse eid="1CH 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22" />Elasar dee na te amul doom ju góor. Ay doom yu jigéen rekk la am. Seeni càmmiñ, doomi Kis, denc leen.<verse eid="1CH 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23" />Doomi Musi yu góor ñoo di Maxli ak Eder ak Yeremot, ñuy ñett.<verse eid="1CH 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24" />Ñooñu ñoo askanoo ci <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Lewi</char>, di ay kilifa ca seeni kër baay, ñu waññ leen, kenn-kenn, bind seeni tur. Ñoo doon ñi am ñaar fukki at ak lu ko ëpp, di liggéey ci kër Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25" />Fekk na Daawuda waxoon ne: «Aji Sax ji Yàllay Israayil jàmmal na ñoñam, dëkk na moom ci boppam ba fàww ci Yerusalem. <verse eid="1CH 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26" />Kon nag soxlaatul Leween ñi di gàddu <char style="w" lemma="xaymab ndaje m-:">xaymab ndaje</char> meek mboolem ndab yi mu àndal te ñu di ko jëfandikoo ci seen liggéey.» <verse eid="1CH 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27" />Dogal bi Daawuda mujja jël daal mooy ñu waññ Leween ñu góor ñi dale ko ci ñi am ñaar fukki at jëm kaw, bind leen.<verse eid="1CH 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28" />Ñu nekk nag ci kilifteefu sëti Aaróona ci liggéeyu kër Aji Sax ji, ca ëtt yaak néeg ya mu feggool. Ñuy sellal jumtukaay yu <char style="w" lemma="sell:">sell</char> ya yépp ba tey, te sasoo yeneen liggéey ca biir kër Yàlla ga. <verse eid="1CH 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29" />Ñoo yoroon itam mburu may tege ca kaw taabal ja, ak sunguf sa ñuy def <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxu pepp</char>, ak mburu yu ndaw ya dul am lawiir, ak yeneen nàkk yu ñuy saaf ak yu ñuy xiiwaale ak diw. Leneen lu ñu doon toppatoo it, di nattukaayu tibb-sotti ya ak nattukaayi guddaay ya. <verse eid="1CH 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30" />Ñu teg ca di teew suba ak ngoon ngir màggal Aji Sax ji, sant ko. <verse eid="1CH 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31" />Ñu boole ci di sarxalal Aji Sax ji mboolem <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxu rendi-dóomal</char> ci <char style="w" lemma="bésub Noflaay b-:">bési Noflaay</char> ak Terutel weer, ak bési màggal; ñuy liggéeyal Aji Sax ji fàww, na leen yoon àppalee ay ya ak na ñu ko wara defe.<verse eid="1CH 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32" />Leween ña nag di sàmm ndénkaaneb xaymab ndaje ma, ak ndénkaaneb béreb bu sell ba, ak ndénkaaneb sëti Aaróona ñiy seeni bokk, ci wàllu liggéeyu kër Aji Sax ji.<verse eid="1CH 23:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda sos na kuréeli sarxalkat yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1" />Sëti Aaróona dees leena séddale ay kuréel yu méngook doomi Aaróona yu góor. Ñuy Nadab ak Abiyu ak Elasar ak Itamar. <verse eid="1CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2" />Nadab ak Abiyu ñoo njëkka dee seen baay te amuñu doom yu góor. Elasar ak Itamar nag doon ay sarxalkat. <verse eid="1CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3" />Gannaaw gi, Daawuda ànd ak Cadog mi askanoo ci Elasar, ak Aximeleg mi askanoo ci Itamar, daldi séddale askanu Aaróona ay kuréel, kuréel gu ci nekk ak wàllam ci liggéey bi. <verse eid="1CH 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4" />Ñu gis nag sëti Elasar gëna bare ay kilifa sëti Itamar. Loolu tax ñu séddale leen, sëti Elasar yu góor di fukki kilifaak juróom benn jiite seen këri baay, sëti Itamar yu góor di juróom ñetti kilifa yu jiite seen këri baay.<verse eid="1CH 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5" />Na ñu séddalee ñenn ñi rekk lañu séddalee ña ca des, ci kaw tegoo bant, ndax amoon na ci biir sëti Elasar ak ci biir sëti Itamar ay jawriñ yu farewoo béreb bu sell bi ak itam ay jawriñ yu sasoo liggéeyu Yàlla bi.<verse eid="1CH 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6" />Ci biir loolu Semaya bindkat ba, doomu Netaneel te bokk ci giirug <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Lewi</char>, daldi bind seeni tur fa kanam Buur ak kilifa ya ak Cadog <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> ba ak Aximeleg doomu Abyatar ak kilifay waa kër sarxalkat yaak waa kër Leween ña. Ñu tegoo nag bant, ngir jël genn kër ci askanu Elasar, jël genn kër ci askanu Itamar.<verse eid="1CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7" />Ci biir loolu, ka bant ba njëkka yemool di Yoyarib, ñaareel ba di Yedaya, <verse eid="1CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8" />ñetteel ba di Arim, ñeenteel ba di Seworim, <verse eid="1CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9" />juróomeel ba di Malkiya, juróom benneel ba di Miyamin, <verse eid="1CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10" />juróom ñaareel ba di Akocc, juróom ñetteel ba di Abya, <verse eid="1CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11" />juróom ñeenteel bi di Yesuwa, fukkeel bi di Sekaña, <verse eid="1CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12" />fukkeel baak benn di Elyasib, fukkeel baak ñaar di Yakim, <verse eid="1CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13" />fukkeel baak ñett di Upa, fukkeel baak ñeent di Yesebab, <verse eid="1CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14" />fukkeel baak juróom di Bilga, fukkeel baak juróom benn di Imer, <verse eid="1CH 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15" />fukkeel baak juróom ñaar di Esir, fukkeel baak juróom ñett di Apicecc, <verse eid="1CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16" />fukkeel baak juróom ñeent di Petaxya, ñaar fukkeel ba di Esekiyel, <verse eid="1CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17" />ñaar fukkeel baak benn Yakin la, ñaar fukkeel baak ñaar di Gamul, <verse eid="1CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18" />ñaar fukkeel baak ñett Delaya la, ñaar fukkeel baak ñeent di Maasya.<verse eid="1CH 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19" />Noonu lañu leen séddalee ay kuréel ci liggéey bi ci biir kër Aji Sax ji. Ñuy def nag li ñu leen sas, ni leen ko seen maam Aaróona digale, te muy la ko Aji Sax ji Yàllay Israayil santoon.<verse eid="1CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeneen sëti Lewi ñii la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20" />Njiiti <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ñi des ñii la: ci askanu Amram, Subayel la; ci askanu Subayel, Yeja la. <verse eid="1CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21" />Ci askanu Rexabya, doomi Rexabya la, njiit la di Isiya. <verse eid="1CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22" />Ci askanu Iccar, Selomot la, ci askanu Selomot, Yaxat la. <verse eid="1CH 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23" />Doomi Ebron yu góor ñoo di Yerya may taaw, Amarya di ñaareel ba, Yaxasyel di ñetteel ba; Yekamam di ñeenteel ba. <verse eid="1CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24" />Doomu Usyel ju góor Mise la. Askanu Mise, Samir bokk na ca. <verse eid="1CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25" />Askanu Isiya mi bokk ak Mise, Sàkkaryaa ca la. <verse eid="1CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26" />Doomi Merari yu góor, Maxli la ak Musi ak Yaasya. <verse eid="1CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27" />Askanu Merari gi soqikoo ci Yaasya, doomam ju góor, Sowam la ak Sakur ak Ibri. <verse eid="1CH 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28" />Doomi Maxli yu góor ñoo di Elasar ma amul doom ju góor, <verse eid="1CH 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29" />ak Kis mi Yeraxmeel di doomam ju góor. <verse eid="1CH 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30" />Doomi Musi yu góor ñoo di Maxli ak Eder ak Yerimot.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:30">Ñooñu ñooy askanu Leween ñi, topp seen kër baay.<verse eid="1CH 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31" />Ñoom itam def ni seeni bokk yi sëtoo ci Aaróona, tegoo bant liggéey bi fa kanam Buur Daawuda ak Cadog ak Aximeleg ak njiiti waa kër <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yaak Leween ña. Njiitu kër gu nekk nag bokk yem kepp ak mbokkam ma ko féete ndaw.<verse eid="1CH 24:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda tabb na woykat yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1" />Ba loolu wéyee Daawuda ànd ak njiiti gàngooru xare ga, daldi ber ñenn ci sëti Asaf ak Eman ak Yedutun, ñu féetewoo liggéeyu jottali kàdduy <char style="w" lemma="waxyu:">waxyu</char>, boole kook tëggum xeeti xalam ak tabala. Ña féetewoo woon boobu liggéey, seen lim a ngi nii:<verse eid="1CH 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2" />Ci wàllu Asaf, doomi Asaf yu góor la, di Sakur ak Yuusufa ak Netaña ak Asareela, seen baay jiite leen, di jottali ay kàdduy waxyu ci ndigalal Buur. <verse eid="1CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3" />Ci wàllu Yedutun, juróom benni doomi Yedutun yu góor la, di Gedalya ak Ceri ak Esayi ak Simey ak Asabya ak Matica; seen baay jiite leen, di jottali ay kàdduy waxyu, ànd ak xeetu xalam di sant aka màggal Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4" />Ci wàllu Eman, doomi Eman yu góor la, di Bukiya ak Mataña ak Usyel ak Sebuwel ak Yerimot ak Anaña ak Anani ak Elyata ak Gidalti ak Romameti Eser ak Yosbekasa ak Maloti ak Otir ak Maxasiyot. <verse eid="1CH 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5" />Góor ñooñu ñépp di doomi Eman boroom peeñu biy liggéeyal Buur bi doon jottali Buur kàddug Yàlla ngir màggal Yàlla. Yàlla may na Eman fukki doom yu góor ak ñeent ak ñetti doom yu jigéen. <verse eid="1CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6" />Ñooñu ñépp nekk ca seen njiital baay ci woyi kër Aji Sax ji, boole kook tëggum xeeti xalam aki tabala, muy seen liggéey ca kër Yàlla ga. Asaf ak Yedutun ak Eman nag nekk ci ndigalal Buur. <verse eid="1CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7" />Ñook seeni bokk nag doonoon ñu mokkal te xareñ ci woy Aji Sax ji, te di ñaari téeméer ak juróom ñett fukk ak juróom ñett (288). <verse eid="1CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8" />Ñu tegoo bant liggéey ba, ñoom ñépp, mag ak ndaw, jàngalekat yaak ndongo ya. <verse eid="1CH 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9" />Noonu ka bant ba njëkka yemool di Asaf mu dal ca Yuusufa; ñaareel ba di Gedalya mook bokkam aki doomam yu góor, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10" />Ñetteel ba di Sakur mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11" />Ñeenteel ba di Icciri mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12" />Juróomeel ba di Netaña mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13" />Juróom benneel ba di Bukiya mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14" />Juróom ñaareel ba di Asareela mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15" />Juróom ñetteel ba di Esayi mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16" />Juróom ñeenteel ba di Mataña mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17" />Fukkeel ba di Simey mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18" />Fukkeel baak benn di Asareel mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19" />Fukkeel baak ñaar di Asabya mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20" />Fukkeel baak ñett di Subayel mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21" />Fukkeel baak ñeent di Matica mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22" />Fukkeel baak juróom di Yeremot mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23" />Fukkeel baak juróom benn di Anaña mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24" />Fukkeel baak juróom ñaar di Yosbekasa mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25" />Fukkeel baak juróom ñett di Anani mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26" />Fukkeel baak juróom ñeent di Maloti mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27" />Ñaar fukkeel ba di Elyata mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28" />Ñaar fukkeel baak benn di Otir mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29" />Ñaar fukkeel baak ñaar di Gidalti mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30" />Ñaar fukkeel baak ñett di Maxasiyot mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar. <verse eid="1CH 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31" />Ñaar fukkeel baak ñeent di Romameti Eser mook doomam yu góor aki bokkam, ñuy fukk ak ñaar.<verse eid="1CH 25:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda tabb na wattukati bunti kër Yàlla ga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Kuréeli wattukati bunt yi, nii lañu ko séddalee woon: Ci askanu Kore, Meselemya la, sëtub Kore, bokk ci doomi Asaf. <verse eid="1CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Ay doomam yu góor di Sàkkaryaa taaw ba, Yediyel di ñaareel ba, Sebaja di ñetteel, Yatniyel di ñeenteel, <verse eid="1CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />Elam di juróomeel, Yoxanan di juróom benneel, Elyowenay di juróom ñaareel.<verse eid="1CH 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4" />Obedd Edom am ay doom yu góor: taaw ba di Semaya, ñaareel ba di Yewosabàdd, ñetteel ba di Yowax, ñeenteel ba di Sakar, juróomeel ba di Netaneel, <verse eid="1CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5" />juróom benneel ba di Amyel, juróom ñaareel ba di Isaakar, juróom ñetteel ba di Pewultay. Obedd Edom nag Yàlla da koo barkeeloon. <verse eid="1CH 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />Taawam Semaya amoon na ay doom yu góor, di ay kilifa ci seen kër baay ndax nit ñu tekki lañu woon. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Doomi Semaya yu góor ñoo di Otni ak Refayel ak Obedd ak Elsabat ñook seeni bokk yu tekki, di Eliyu ak Semakiya. <verse eid="1CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Ñooñu ñépp sëti Obedd Edom lañu, ñook seen doom yu góor ak seeni bokk; ñuy nit ñu tekki diy jàmbaar ci liggéey bi, tollu ci juróom benn fukk ak ñaar ñu ñu waññal Obedd Edom.<verse eid="1CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Kuréelu Meselemya doomam yu góor a ca nekk aki bokkam, di fukki nit ak juróom ñett ñu tekki.<verse eid="1CH 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10" />Osa mu làngug Merari am na ñeenti doom yu góor, Simri jiitu ca, baayam def ko njiit doonte du taaw; <verse eid="1CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11" />Ilkiya di ñaareel ba, Tebalya di ñetteel ba, Sàkkaryaa di ñeenteel ba. Kuréelu Osa mboolem doomam yu góor a ca nekk aki bokkam, di fukki nit ak ñett.<verse eid="1CH 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />Ci mboolem kuréeli wattukati bunt yooyu, kilifa yaak ña ca des dañu daan def seen liggéey ci biir kër Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" />Dañoo tegoo bant bunt bu nekk, ngir jox ko waa kër gi koy wattu, mag ñeek ndaw ñi bokk ci yem. <verse eid="1CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Ka muurloo buntu penku ba nag di Selemya. Sàkkaryaa, doomam ju góor ja amoon xel mu ñaw, daldi muurloo bunt ba féete bëj-gànnaar. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Obedd Edom féetewoo buntub bëj-saalum, ay doomam yu góor féetewoo këri dencukaay ya. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16" />Suppim a nga feggook Osa bokk di wattu buntub sowu ba ak buntub Saleket bay ubbikoo ca yoonu yéeg ga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 26:16">Kuréeli wattukat yi nii lañu leen sase woon: <verse eid="1CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17" />Amoon na juróom benni <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> yu aye wetu penku bés bu nekk, ak ñeenti Leween wetu bëj-gànnaar bés bu nekk, ak ñeent ca bëj-saalum bés bu nekk, ak ñaar ñuy awanteek ñaar ca dencukaay ya. <verse eid="1CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />Ñeent a nekkoon ca mbedd ma, ngir ëtt ba ca sowu; ñaar nekk ca ëtt ba. <verse eid="1CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Looloo doon kuréeli wattukati bunt ya bokkoon ca askanu Kore ak Merari.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawuda tabb na saytukati alal yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Yeneen <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char>, ñu mel ni Axya lañu dénkoon alali kër Yàlla ga ak alal yu <char style="w" lemma="sell:">sell</char> ya. <verse eid="1CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21" />Sëti Ladan mu làngu Gerson, diy kilifa ci seeni waa kër, doomam Yexyelee ci bokkoon. <verse eid="1CH 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22" />Doomi Yexyeli yu góor ñooy Setam ak Yowel. Mbokku Yexyeli di wattu alali kër Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Ci wàllu làngi Amram ak làngu Iccar ak làngu Ebron ak làngu Usyel: <verse eid="1CH 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />Sebuwel, ma askanoo ca Gersom, doomu Musaa ju góor, moo doon jawriñ ja ñu dénk alal ya. <verse eid="1CH 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />Bokkam yi soqikoo ci Elyeser nii lañu toppantee: Rexabya ak Esayi ak Yoram ak Sikkri ak Selomit. <verse eid="1CH 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Selomit mooki bokkam lañu dénkoon mboolem alal yu sell ya, te ña ko sellalal Aji Sax ji, di Buur Daawuda ak kilifay kër ña jiite woon kuréeli junniy nit ak ña jiite woon kuréeli téeméer ya ak yeneen njiiti mboolooy xare ya. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />Ñooñu dañoo jëloon ca la ñu lële ca ay xare, jagleel ko liggéeyu kër Aji Sax ja ñuy defaraat. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Mboolem lu ñu sellal te ña ko sellalal Aji Sax ji, di Samiyel boroom gis ba, ak Sawul doomu Kis, ak Abner doomu Ner, ak Yowab doomu Ceruya, ak yeneen yu ñu sellal yépp, dañu ko tegoon ca loxol Selomit mooki bokkam.<verse eid="1CH 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawuda tabb na yeneen jawriñam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />Ñi bokk ci làngu Iccar, di Kenaña aki doomam yu góor, ñoo gàddu woon mbiri biir dëkk ba ca Israayil, yore saytu ba ak àtte ba. <verse eid="1CH 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />Ñi bokk ci làngu Ebron, di Asabya aki bokkam, di junniy nit ak juróom ñaari téeméer (1 700) ñu tekki, ñoo yilifoon wetu Israayil gi féete dexu Yurdan sowu ci mboolem lu jëm ci liggéeyu Aji Sax ji ak liggéeyu buur. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />Ci wàllu làngu Ebron, Yerya moo doon kilifa ga. Ca ñeent fukkeelu atu nguurug Daawuda, seet nañu ba gis ca seen biir, ca Yaser ga ca diiwaanu Galàdd, ay nit ñu tekki ñu bokk ca ñoom. <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />Yerya amoon na ñaari junniy bokkam ak juróom ñaari téeméer (2 700), ñuy nit ñu tekki, jiite seeni kër baay. Buur Daawuda dénk leen saytub waa giirug Ruben ak giiru Gàdd ak genn-wàllu giirug Manase ci mboolem lu jëm ci mbiri Yàlla ak mbiri Buur.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda tabb na njiiti xareem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Nii lañu lime <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> yi nekkoon ay kilifa ci seen kër baay, doon njiiti kuréeli junni ak kuréeli téeméeri nit, te nekkoon saytukat yi doon jàppale Buur ci lu jëm ci kuréelu xarekat yi aye ci liggéey bi weer wu nekk. Kuréel gu nekk ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) a ca nekkoon.<verse eid="1CH 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2" />Ka jiite woon kuréel gu njëkk ga ca weer wu njëkk wa, Yasobam la, doomu Sabdiyel. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3" />Mu ngi askanoo ci Peres, di kilifag mboolem jawriñi gàngoori xare ya ca weer wu njëkk wa. <verse eid="1CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Ka jiite woon kuréelu ñaareelu weer wa, Doday la, te mu askanoo ci Axowa; Miglot topp ci moom, jiite kuréelam. Kuréel ga ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Kilifag ñetteelu mbooloo ma ca ñetteelu weer wa, Benaya la woon, doomu Yoyada, <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> bu mag ba. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Benaya moomoo doon jàmbaari xare ja bokkoon ca Fanweeri jàmbaar ya, jiite leen. Amisabat, doomam ju góor bokk ca kuréel ga. <verse eid="1CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Ñeenteelu kilifa ga ca ñeenteelu weer wa, Asayel la, mbokkum Yowab; Sebaja, doomam ju góor moo ko wuutu. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Juróomeelu kilifa ga ca juróomeelu weer wa, Samut la, bokk ci làngu Israx. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Juróom benneelu kilifa ga ca juróom benneelu weer wa, Ira la woon, doomu Ikes mu Tekowa. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Juróom ñaareelu kilifa ga ca juróom ñaareelu weer wa, Elecc la woon, mu Palon, bokk ca giirug Efrayim. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Juróom ñetteelu kilifa ga ca juróom ñetteelu weer wa, Sibekay la woon, mu Usa, bokk ca làngu Sera. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Juróom ñeenteelu kilifa ga ca juróom ñeenteelu weer wa, Abiyeser la woon, mu Anatot, bokk ca giirug Beñamin. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Fukkeelu kilifa ga ca fukkeelu weer wa, Maaray la woon, mu Netofa, bokk ca làngu Sera. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Fukkeelu kilifa gaak benn ca fukkeelu weer waak benn, Benaya la woon, mu Piraton, bokk ca giirug Efrayim. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon. <verse eid="1CH 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Fukkeelu kilifa gaak ñaar ca fukkeelu weer waak ñaar, Elday la woon, mu Netofa, bokk ca làngug Otniyel. Kuréelam ñaar fukki junniy nit ak ñeent (24 000) la woon.<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilifay giiri Israayil ñii la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Kilifay giiri Israayil nag ñii la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 27:16">Giirug Ruben, kilifa ga Elyeser la, doomu Sikkri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 27:16">Kilifag giirug Simeyon Sefatiya la, doomu Maaka.<verse eid="1CH 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />Kilifag giirug <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Lewi</char> Asabya la, doomu Kemwel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 27:17">Kilifag waa kër Aaróona, Cadog la.<verse eid="1CH 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />Kilifag giirug Yuda Eliyu la, mbokkum Daawuda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 27:18">Kilifag giirug Isaakar Omri la, doomu Mikayel.<verse eid="1CH 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />Kilifag giirug Sabulon Ismaya la, doomu Abdiyas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 27:19">Kilifag giirug Neftali di Yerimot doomu Asriyel.<verse eid="1CH 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />Kilifag giirug Efrayim Ose la, doomu Asasya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 27:20">Kilifag genn-wàllu giirug Manase ga ca sowub dexu Yurdan, Yowel la, doomu Pedaya.<verse eid="1CH 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />Kilifag genn-wàllu giirug Manase ga ca penkub dexu Yurdan, ca Galàdd, Ido la, doomu Sàkkaryaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 27:21">Kilifag giirug Beñamin, Yaasyel la, doomu Abner.<verse eid="1CH 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />Kilifag giirug Dan, Asareel la, doomu Yeroxam.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:22">Ñooñu ñoo doon kilifay giirug Israayil.<verse eid="1CH 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />Daawuda nag boolewu ci limu nit ñi am ñaar fukki at ak lu ko yées ndax Aji Sax ji dige woon na ne dina giiral Israayil ba ñu tollook biddiiwi asamaan. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" />Yowab doomu Ceruya tàmbali woon na leen lim sax, waaye sottalul, ndax loolu taxoon na sànjum Yàlla wàcc ci kaw Israayil. Moo tax lim ba bokkul ca limeefu téere bi ñu dippee Jaloorey Buur Daawuda cay jantam.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saytukati alal yi ñii la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Ci biir loolu, ka ñu dénkoon këri dencukaay Buur, Asmawet la, doomu Adiyel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:25">Ka ñu dénkoon dencukaayi tool yi ci dëkk yu ndaw yeek yi ci dëkk-dëkkaan yeek tata yi, Yonatan la, doomu Osiyas.<verse eid="1CH 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />Ka jiite woon surga yay liggéey ca tool ya, di bey, Esri la, doomu Kelub.<verse eid="1CH 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />Ka ñu dénkoon tóokëri reseñ ya, Simey mu Raama la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:27">Ka ñu dénkoon mbàndi biiñ ba ñu nale ca reseñ ya, di Sabdi mu Sefam.<verse eid="1CH 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Ka ñu dénkoon garabi oliw yaak garabi sikomoor ya ca suufu tund ya, mooy Baal Anan mu Bet Geder.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:28">Ka ñu dénkoon denci diwu oliw ya di Yowas.<verse eid="1CH 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Ka ñu dénkoon nag ya ca parlu ya ca jooru Saron, mooy Sittray mu Saron.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:29">Ka ñu dénkoon nag ya ca xur ya, di Safat doomu Adlay.<verse eid="1CH 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Ka ñu dénkoon giléem ya, Obil la, bokk ca giirug Ismayla.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:30">Ka ñu dénkoon mbaam ya, di Yeja mu Meronot.<verse eid="1CH 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Ka ñu dénkoon gàtt ya, Yasis la, bokk ci giirug Agar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:31">Ñooñu ñépp diy jawriñ yu ñu dénk alalu Buur Daawuda.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeneen jawriñ a ngi nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />Yonatan, baay bu ndawu Daawuda, di ku rafet xel te am njàng, moo doon xelal Buur Daawuda. Yexyel doomu Agmoni yore njàngu doomi Buur. <verse eid="1CH 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" />Axitofel it doon na xelal Buur; Usay Arkeen ba di ab xejjam. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />Ña wuutu Axitofel, Yoyada la, doomu Benaya, ak Abyatar. Njiital gàngoori xarey Buur di Yowab.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Daawuda dénku na askan wi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Ba loolu amee Daawuda woolu ca Yerusalem kilifay Israayil yépp, di kilifay giir yaak kilifay kuréel ya ca liggéeyu buur ak kilifay kuréeli junni yaak kilifay kuréeli téeméeri nit ya ak ña ñu dénk alali buur yépp ak juri Buur ak juri doomam yu góor, ak jawriñi kër buur yaak jàmbaari xare ñaak mboolem ñeyi xare ya. <verse eid="1CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" />Daawuda taxaw, ne leen: «Yeen bokk yiy sama ñoñ, dégluleen ma: Damaa nammoon ci sama xol ne dinaa tabaxal <char style="w" lemma="gaalu kóllëre g-:">gaalu kóllërey Aji Sax</char> ji kërug noppalukaay, muy sunu ndëggastalu Yàlla, te doon naa ko waaja tabax. <verse eid="1CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />Waaye Yàlla ne ma: “Du yaw yaa may tabaxal kër gu ñuy may tudde, ndax nitu xare nga te tuur nga deret ju bare.” <verse eid="1CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />Terewul Aji Sax ji Yàllay Israayil tànn ma ci sama mboolem kër baay, may buurub Israayil ba fàww. Soob na ko moos mu jiital giirug Yuda, tànne ca kër Yuda saa kër baay, te góor ñi sama baay jur it man la ci tànn, fal ma, may buurub Israayil gépp. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />Ci biir loolu, sama doom yu góor yépp, te Yàlla may na ma doom yu góor yu bare, sama doom Suleymaan la ci tànn, teg ko ci jalu nguuru Aji Sax ji, ci kaw Israayil. <verse eid="1CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />Mu ne ma: “Sa doom Suleymaan mooy tabax sama kër ak samay ëtt, ndax maa ko tànnal sama bopp, mu mel ni sama doom, ma mel ni baayam. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />Maay saxal nguuram ba fàww, ndegam sax na, ni bésu tey jii ci jëfe samay santaane ak sama dogali yoon.” <verse eid="1CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />Kon nag dénk naa leen, Israayil, ñoñi Aji Sax ji, yeen ñépp di gis, sunu Yàlla di dégg. Sàmmleen mboolem seen santaaney Yàlla Aji Sax ji, te topp ci, su ko defee réew mu baax mi des ci seeni loxo, ngeen donale ko seeni sët yi leen fiy wuutu ba fàww.<verse eid="1CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawuda dénku na Suleymaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />«Yaw Suleymaan, doom, nanga wuta xam bu baax Yàlla ji ma gëm, man sa baay, te jaamoo ko xol bu ko wéetal ak xel mu ko déggal. Ndax biir xolu ku nekk Aji Sax ji da koy xool, te mboolem lu nit namm, di ko mébét xam na ko. Soo ko toppee, dina la ubbil boppam. Waaye soo ko dëddoo, dina la xarab ba fàww. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />Xoolal rekk ni Aji Sax ji tànne, nga tabaxal ko kër, muy béreb bu sell. Dëgërlul nag te taxaw ci.»<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Ba mu ko defee Daawuda jox doomam Suleymaan misaalu mbaaru buntu jaamookaay bi ak tabax ya ca bokk ak néegi dencukaay yaak néegi kaw yaak néegi biir ya ak néeg bay def kubeeru njotlaay gi ci kaw <char style="w" lemma="gaalu kóllëre g-:">gaal</char> gi. <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />Mu jox ko itam misaalu mboolem lu ko leerug Yàlla xiiroon, ngir mu tabax ko, muy ëtti kër Aji Sax ji ak mboolem tabax ya koy wër, ak dencukaayi kër Aji Sax ji ak dencukaayi jumtukaay yu <char style="w" lemma="sell:">sell</char> ya. <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />Ci kaw loolu mu limal ko kuréeli <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char> yaak <char style="w" lemma="Leween b-:">Leween</char> ñaak mboolem sas yi bokk ci liggéeyu kër Aji Sax ji, ak itam mboolem jumtukaay ya ñuy liggéeye ci kër Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />Won na ko it diisaay ba war ca lépp luy wurus ak lu ñu koy liggéeye, ak diisaay ba war ca lépp luy xaalis ak lu ñu koy liggéeye. <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />Wax na ko itam diisaayu tegukaayi làmpi wurus ya ak seen làmpi wurus, làmp bu ci nekk ak diisaayam; tegukaayi làmpi xaalis ya it ak diisaay ba ca war, ak seeni làmp, bu ci nekk ak na ñu koy jëfandikoo. <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />Won na ko ba tey diisaayu wurus wa ñuy defare taabal ya ñuy teg mburu yu sell ma ca kanam Aji Sax ji, ak diisaayu xaalis ba ñuy defare taabali xaalis ya. <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />Jox na ko itam misaalu seppikaayi yàpp yiy am bëñ, ak ndab yi ñuy tuuroo, ak njaq ya, ak diisaayu wurus wa ñuy defare ndabal wurus wu nekk, ak diisaayu xaalis ba ñuy defare ndabal xaalis bu nekk, <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />ak diisaayu wurus wu raxul wa ñuy defare <char style="w" lemma="sarxalukaay b-:">sarxalukaayu</char> cuuraay ba, joxati ko misaalu watiir wa, te mooy jëmmi <char style="w" lemma="serub y-:">serub</char> yu wurus yay tàllal seeni laaf, yiire ko gaalu kóllërey Aji Sax ji.<verse eid="1CH 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />Daawuda nag ne: «Loolu yépp bindees na ko, Aji Sax ji moo ma teg loxo, leeralal ma mboolem li ñu faramfàcce ci misaal mi.» <verse eid="1CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />Daawuda dellu ne doomam Suleymaan: «Dëgërlul nag te am fit te liggéey. Bul tiit, bul yoqi, ndax Aji Sax ji Yàlla miy sama Yàlla mu ngi ànd ak yaw. Du la wor, du la wacc, ba keroog njeextel mboolem lu ñuy def ci liggéeyu kër Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Te kat kuréeli sarxalkat yeek Leween ñaa ngi taxaw ngir lépp lu ñuy liggéey ci kër Yàlla gi, ak mboolem ku ko xolam nangu te mu xareñ ci bépp xeetu liggéey. Jawriñ ñeek askan wépp it dinañu la déggal ci lépp loo santaane.»<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Askan wi jàpp nañu ci liggéey bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />Ba loolu amee Buur Daawuda wax mbooloo ma mépp ne leen: «Sama doom Suleymaan mi Yàlla tànn moom doŋŋ, da di ndaw te néew doole. Liggéey bi nag réy na, ndax du nit a moom tabax bi, waaye Aji Sax ji Yàlla moo ko moom. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />Sama doole yépp def naa ko ci sama tabaxu kër Yàlla gi. Muy wurus wu jëm ci lu ñuy liggéeye wurus, ak xaalis bu jëm ci lu ñuy liggéeye xaalis, ak xànjar bu jëm ci lu ñuy liggéeye xànjar, ak weñ gu ñuul gu jëm ci lu ñuy liggéeye weñ gu ñuul, ak bant bu jëm ci lu ñuy liggéeye bant, ak peri onigsë ak yeneen xeer yuy rafetal ak per yu ñuul ak peri yeneen melo, di mboolem xeeti per yu jafe ak doji màrb yu bare. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Gannaaw loolu pastéef gi ma am ci sama kër Yàlla gi, tax na def naa sama alali bopp, muy wurus ak xaalis ci sama tabaxu kër Yàlla, mu dolliku ci kaw mboolem lu ma joxe woon ci kër gu sell gii. <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4" />Junniy (1 000) barigoy wurusu Ofir la, ak ñaari junneek ñeenti téeméeri (2 400) barigoy xaalis bu ñuy lale miiri kër Yàlla gi. <verse eid="1CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5" />Wurus woowu ak xaalis boobu jëm ci lépp lu ñuy defare wurus mbaa xaalis ak mboolem lu liggéeykat yiy wara def. Léegi nag, ana ku ci yéenee def loxoom, sédd ko Aji Sax ji, bésub tey?» <verse eid="1CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Ñu daldi joxe ci xol bu tàlli, muy kilifa ya jiite seen këri baay ak kilifay giiri Israayil ak njiiti junni yaak njiiti téeméer yaak jawriñ ya jiite liggéeyu Buur. <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />Def nañu ca liggéeyu kër Yàlla ga junneek juróom ñaari téeméeri (1 700) barigoy wurus, ak fukki junniy (10 000) poseti wurus, ak lu ëpp ñetti junniy ak ñeenti téeméeri (3 400) barigoy xaalis, ak lu ëpp juróom benni junniy (6 000) barigoy xànjar, ak lu ëpp fanweeri junniy ak ñeenti téeméeri (34 000) barigoy weñ gu ñuul. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Ci biir loolu ñi dencoon ay per yu jafe teg ko ci loxol Yexyel ma bokk ca làngu Gerson, mu jëm ci alali kër Aji Sax ji. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Mbooloo ma bég ca yéene ja ñu am, ba joxeel Aji Sax ji ci xol bu tàlli bu ko wéetal. Buur Daawuda itam am ca mbégte mu réy.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawuda sant na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Ba mu ko defee Daawuda sant Aji Sax ji, fa kanam mbooloo ma mépp, daldi ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:10">«Cant ñeel na la ba fàww, yaw Aji Sax ji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:10">yaw, sunu Yàllay maam Israayil.<verse eid="1CH 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" />Yaw, Aji Sax ji, yaa yelloo màggaay ak doole,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:11">teraanga ak ndam ak daraja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:11">Aji Sax ji, mboolem li ci asamaan ak suuf</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:11">yaay boroom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:11">Yaay boroom nguur gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:11">di Buur bu kawe, sut lépp.<verse eid="1CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" />Alal ak daraja yaa koy joxe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:12">te yaa tiim lépp.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:12">Dooleek kàttan ci say loxo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:12">Yaay yékkati ku la soob, dooleel ko.<verse eid="1CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />Kon sunu Yàlla, nu ngi lay sant,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:13">di màggal sa tur wu tedd.<verse eid="1CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />Ana lu nu tekki, maak sama ñoñ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:14">ba nu man laa jox saraxi yéene yii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:14">Ci yaw la lépp jóge, te say loxo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:14">lanu jële, jox la.<verse eid="1CH 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />Ay doxandéem lanu fi yaw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:15">diy gan ni sunuy maam yépp.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:15">Sunu fani kaw suuf, takkndeer buy wéy la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:15">yaakaar amu ci.<verse eid="1CH 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />Yaw Aji Sax ji, sunu Yàlla,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:16">alal jii nu dajale, mu ne gàññ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:16">di ko tabaxe kër gu ñuy tudde sa tur wu sell,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:16">Ci say loxo la jóge, lépp yaay boroom.<verse eid="1CH 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />Sama Yàlla, xam naa ne kuy natt xolub jaam nga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:17">te sopp njubte. Ci yéeney njub it laa joxee lii lépp.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:17">Ma gisati, tey bég ci sa mbooloo mii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:17">di la jox seen saraxi yéene.<verse eid="1CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />Éy Aji Sax ji, Yàllay Ibraaymaak Isaaxaak Israayil, sunuy maam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:18">saxalal ci sa mbooloo seen yéeney xol ak seen xalaat yii ci yaw;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:18">seeni xol wéy ci wéetal la.<verse eid="1CH 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />Ngalla mayal sama doom Suleymaan xol bu la wéetal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:19">muy sàmm say santaane ak say ndigal ak say dogal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:19">di jëfe lépp te tabax kër gi ma waajal.»<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Ba loolu amee Daawuda wax mbooloo mépp, ne leen: «Màggalleen seen Yàlla, Aji Sax ji.» Mbooloo ma mépp màggal Aji Sax ji, seen Yàllay maam, daldi sëgg, sujjóotal Aji Sax ji ak Buur Daawuda.<verse eid="1CH 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nguuru Suleymaan taxaw na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" />Ca ëllëg sa ñu defal Aji Sax ji ay sarax, defal ko ay <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxi rendi-dóomal</char>: reyal nañu ko junniy yëkk ak junniy kuuy yu mag ak junniy kuuy yu ndaw; ñu boole ca <char style="w" lemma="Sarax yi:">saraxi tuuru</char> ya muy àndal ak yeneen sarax yu bare yu doy <char style="w" lemma="bànni Israayil:">bànni Israayil</char> gépp. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />Ñu daldi lekk, naan fa kanam Aji Sax ji, nekk ci mbégte mu réy, bésub keroog. Ci biir loolu ñu biral, muy ñaareel bi yoon ne Suleymaan doomu Daawuda doon na buur, ba noppi ñu fal ko fi kanam Aji Sax ji, mu jiite leen, falaale Cadog muy <char style="w" lemma="sarxalkat b-:">sarxalkat</char>. <verse eid="1CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" />Ba loolu amee Suleymaan toog ci jalu Aji Sax ji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seetal ci 28.5-6.</char></note>, di buur, wuutu baayam. Nguuram nag barkeel, Israayil gépp déggal ko. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Ci kaw loolu jawriñ ñépp nangul Suleymaan, ñook jàmbaari xare ñaak mboolem doomi Buur Daawuda yu góor ya ca des. <verse eid="1CH 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />Aji Sax ji nag yékkati Suleymaan lool, Israayil gépp di gis; mu jagleel ko darajay nguur ju benn buurub Israayil masuloona am.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buur Daawuda saay na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Daawuda doomu Yese, moom, nekkoon na buurub Israayil gépp. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" />Nguuru na Israayil ñeent fukki at, di juróom ñaari at yu mu nguuroo Ebron, ak fanweeri at ak ñett yu mu nguuroo Yerusalem. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Ma nga nelaw gannaaw ba mu guddee fan ba màggat lool, am alal ak daraja. Doomam Suleymaan moo falu buur wuutu ko.<verse eid="1CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />Jaar-jaari Buur Daawuda nag, fa mu tàmbalee ba fa mu yem, mu ngi ñu bind moos ci téere yi indi jëfi Samiyel, boroom gis ba, ak téereb Natan yonent ba, ak téereb Gàdd, boroom peeñu ba. <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />Ñu indaale ca mboolem lu jëm ci nguuram ak doole ja mu amoon, ak mboolem lu ko dal moom ci boppam, ak lu dal Israayil ak mboolem nguuri yeneen réew ya.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>